# game/script.rpy:20
translate chinese ep1_0eecb344:

    # mc "Hi! My name is [mc!t]. I'm 23 years old."
    mc "嗨！我的名字是[mc!t]。我今年23岁了。"

# game/script.rpy:23
translate chinese ep1_3730dbd5:

    # mc "I can proudly say that I'm quite a decent guy."
    mc "我可以自豪地说我是个不错的男人。"

# game/script.rpy:24
translate chinese ep1_fbd331e1:

    # mc "Good brain with a nice body build... I mean, what more could I ask for?"
    mc "脑袋聪明，身材也好……还能要求点别的什么呢？"

# game/script.rpy:25
translate chinese ep1_9bc62e0b:

    # mc "Maybe money?"
    mc "可能还得有钱？"

# game/script.rpy:26
translate chinese ep1_62463481:

    # mc "Well, I'd be lying to myself if I told you that I don't need it. We all need it to survive in this world."
    mc "好吧，要是我说我不想要钱，那纯粹是胡扯。没钱根本在这个世界上活不下去。"

# game/script.rpy:27
translate chinese ep1_f033c945:

    # mc "Money makes the world go round. But, we need to work for it."
    mc "全世界都靠钱运转。但是，我们需要努力工作来赚钱。"

# game/script.rpy:28
translate chinese ep1_99c9528b:

    # mc "However, it's not that easy with the current state of society."
    mc "然而，现在这个社会，那也是很困难的。"

# game/script.rpy:29
translate chinese ep1_631897f9:

    # mc "To tell you the truth, I even graduated college with honors, but I haven't had any luck finding a decent job."
    mc "实话实说，我是作为优秀毕业生毕业的，但我也没找到一个像样的工作。"

# game/script.rpy:30
translate chinese ep1_58a65726:

    # mc "Even someone who graduated with honors like me is getting rejected in the corporate world."
    mc "即使是我这样的优秀毕业生也在大人的世界处处碰壁。"

# game/script.rpy:31
translate chinese ep1_3a288e5c:

    # mc "So... I decided to temporarily work at a burger shack, until I could find a job within my field of study."
    mc "所以……我决定先暂时在一家汉堡店打工，直到我在我的专业领域找到一份合适的工作。"

# game/script.rpy:32
translate chinese ep1_2f28d1ff:

    # mc "I mean... what else could I have done? At least the pay can cover my daily expenses and needs."
    mc "哥们儿……别的我还能干些什么？至少那的工资够我的日常花销了。"

# game/script.rpy:33
translate chinese ep1_499c8e1e:

    # mc "And what's more, the more work experience you have, the easier it is for you to be accepted in much bigger jobs."
    mc "而且，积累点工作经验也能更轻松地找到更好的工作。"

# game/script.rpy:36
translate chinese ep1_d640900a:

    # mc "Also, I'm extremely thankful to this girl.."
    mc "另外，我还要谢谢这个女孩……"

# game/script.rpy:37
translate chinese ep1_7f25cb3f:

    # mc "Her name is Sky."
    mc "她的名字叫斯凯。"

# game/script.rpy:53
translate chinese ep1_bafbd12a:

    # mc "She is my [roommate!t]."
    mc "她是我的[roommate!t]。"

# game/script.rpy:54
translate chinese ep1_25cb6731:

    # mc "She's a very lovely girl who always takes care of me and the entire house."
    mc "她非常可爱，还一直照顾我，打理整个房子。"

# game/script.rpy:55
translate chinese ep1_598b3823:

    # mc "At the moment, she is working as an online English tutor for foreign kids."
    mc "目前，她的工作是给国外的孩子提供在线英语教学。"

# game/script.rpy:56
translate chinese ep1_f8b357cf:

    # mc "But despite it being stressful, I can still see that she loves her job."
    mc "尽管压力不小，但我能看得出来她十分热爱这份工作。"

# game/script.rpy:57
translate chinese ep1_9ccfc2bc:

    # mc "We're close to each other, probably too close, heheh."
    mc "我们的关系非常亲近，可能亲近过头了，嘿嘿。"

# game/script.rpy:58
translate chinese ep1_0145c4ec:

    # mc "We help and support each other however we can with our struggles in life."
    mc "我们在生活中的方方面面都互相照顾。"

# game/script.rpy:59
translate chinese ep1_c0c98b93:

    # mc "Don't let her height fool you — believe me when I say that she's just a year younger than me. Hahaha..."
    mc "别看她这么矮，其实她只比我小一岁。哈哈哈……"

# game/script.rpy:60
translate chinese ep1_2158045f:

    # mc "She's really cute, isn't she?"
    mc "她真是可爱极了，对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:63
translate chinese ep1_e13db5aa:

    # mc "And this is Klara."
    mc "这位是克拉拉。"

# game/script.rpy:79
translate chinese ep1_b3ab9eb5:

    # mc "She is my [landlady!t]."
    mc "她是我的[landlady!t]。"

# game/script.rpy:80
translate chinese ep1_1ef2a536:

    # mc "She's currently working abroad for two years, and left the house to me and Sky."
    mc "她在国外工作两年了，把房子留给我和斯凯两个人住。"

# game/script.rpy:81
translate chinese ep1_dce788b3:

    # mc "When will she be back, you ask?"
    mc "你问她什么时候才回来？"

# game/script.rpy:82
translate chinese ep1_14ae9c63:

    # mc "I have no idea. She seems to be doing fine, so there's probably no reason for her to come back soon."
    mc "我还真不知道。目前看起来一切顺利，所以可能一段时间之内她都不会回来了。"

# game/script.rpy:85
translate chinese ep1_29cd67de:

    # mc "Everything is going fine at the moment..."
    mc "目前万事如意……"

# game/script.rpy:86
translate chinese ep1_d72c8e9f:

    # mc "...or so I would say..."
    mc "……我本来想这么说……"

# game/script.rpy:90
translate chinese ep1_4c127351:

    # mc "...Because the girl who bullied me in highschool..."
    mc "……但之前在我上高中的时候霸凌我的那几个女孩……"

# game/script.rpy:91
translate chinese ep1_0b702fe0:

    # mc "...is here right now, in front of me."
    mc "……不知道怎么回事，现在就站在我的面前。"

# game/script.rpy:98
translate chinese ep1_b3191472:

    # s "Pssst! Wake uuuup!"
    s "喂喂喂！起床啦！"

# game/script.rpy:99
translate chinese ep1_d0aa7075:

    # s "Wake up~!"
    s "快起床~！"

# game/script.rpy:102
translate chinese ep1_a2d40cbd:

    # mc "Hmmmm??"
    mc "嗯嗯？？"

# game/script.rpy:103
translate chinese ep1_5c94cd91:

    # s "[mc!t], wake up or you're going to be late!"
    s "[mc!t]，快起床，不然你就迟到啦！"

# game/script.rpy:106
translate chinese ep1_18d6b2b6:

    # mc "Hmmm... Sky? What time is it?"
    mc "哦……斯凯？几点了？"

# game/script.rpy:107
translate chinese ep1_75dca75f:

    # s "It's already 6 am!"
    s "都已经六点了！"

# game/script.rpy:108
translate chinese ep1_5ade8b77:

    # mc "Ohh... don't worry, I still have a lot of time..."
    mc "哦……没事没事，那我还不用急……"

# game/script.rpy:109
translate chinese ep1_3b21f354:

    # mc "......"
    mc "......"

# game/script.rpy:112
translate chinese ep1_3f871f46:

    # mc "Hmm?"
    mc "嗯？"

# game/script.rpy:113
translate chinese ep1_73d038d0:

    # mc "Wait, w-what the heck are you doing, Sky?"
    mc "等等，你——你在干嘛啊，斯凯？"

# game/script.rpy:114
translate chinese ep1_01dd8ac4:

    # s "Eh? What do you mean?"
    s "嗯？什么意思？"

# game/script.rpy:117
translate chinese ep1_6303d05f:

    # mc "I can literally see your panties right now!"
    mc "你的内裤都被我看光了！"

# game/script.rpy:118
translate chinese ep1_a44402f2:

    # s "Oh? What does it matter? You see them all the time, don't you?"
    s "啊？那又怎么了？你不是经常看吗？"

# game/script.rpy:119
translate chinese ep1_c6285e4a:

    # mc "Well, yes! But you're in my bed right now and..."
    mc "好吧，确实！但你现在在我床上而且我还……"

# game/script.rpy:122
translate chinese ep1_1f1f097c:

    # mc "I can see your..."
    mc "能看见你的……"

# game/script.rpy:123
translate chinese ep1_a525f393:

    # s "See my what?"
    s "看见我的什么？"

# game/script.rpy:124
translate chinese ep1_3b1df4e4:

    # yt "This girl..."
    yt "这丫头……"

# game/script.rpy:125
translate chinese ep1_e7bab589:

    # yt "Ever since we both reached adulthood, we've noticed changes in our bodies, and we also noticed one more thing..."
    yt "自从我们都成年之后，我们不仅注意到了自己身体上的变化，也注意到了些别的东西……"

# game/script.rpy:126
translate chinese ep1_35eac523:

    # yt "I know it is totally wrong, so I've been holding back and telling myself that it is wrong... "
    yt "我知道这是错的，所以我一直压抑自己，也不断提醒自己那是错的……"

# game/script.rpy:127
translate chinese ep1_cc928864:

    # yt "But... I'm actually sexually attracted to my own [roommate!t]. And I know that she's attracted to me too."
    yt "但是……我不得不承认我对我的[roommate!t]有了感觉。而且我敢肯定她对我也有一样的感觉。"

# game/script.rpy:128
translate chinese ep1_debd0b0e:

    # yt "Damn it! I should find an excuse to get out of this situation!"
    yt "可恶！我得想个办法脱身！"

# game/script.rpy:129
translate chinese ep1_4cf5a24e:

    # mc "N-nothing! I'll go ahead and get ready now or I will be late for work!"
    mc "没——没事！我得赶紧起床准备了，不然上班要迟到了！"

# game/script.rpy:130
translate chinese ep1_ad7d8926:

    # s "Didn't you say that you still have a lot of time?"
    s "你刚刚不还说不急吗？"

# game/script.rpy:131
translate chinese ep1_9553a141:

    # mc "Ahhh! Nevermind!"
    mc "要你管！"

# game/script.rpy:140
translate chinese ep1_774e4b54:

    # "*knocks*"
    "*敲门*"

# game/script.rpy:141
translate chinese ep1_da2eac8c:

    # mc "Hey, Sky! I'm going now!"
    mc "斯凯！我要走咯！"

# game/script.rpy:142
translate chinese ep1_eaa76774:

    # s "Alright! Take care! And don't forget to bring me home some burgers!"
    s "好！路上小心！回来的时候别忘了给我带汉堡！"

# game/script.rpy:143
translate chinese ep1_52e4f359:

    # mc "Sure!"
    mc "得嘞！"

# game/script.rpy:144
translate chinese ep1_dbbbf9b0:

    # yt "She sure likes burgers a lot. I'm wondering why she doesn't get fat, the way she eats."
    yt "她确实特别喜欢汉堡。我都奇怪她为什么怎么吃都不胖。"

# game/script.rpy:145
translate chinese ep1_f5ef7b5a:

    # yt "I may be working in a burger shack, but I hate all the carbs! I need to maintain my diet or I'll just go back to the old me."
    yt "我虽然在汉堡店工作，但我一点也不喜欢碳水！我必须注意饮食，不然我就会变回以前的样子了。"

# game/script.rpy:146
translate chinese ep1_bc151577:

    # yt "Fortunately, Sky knows about it and helps me since she's the one in charge of cooking."
    yt "幸运的是，负责做饭的斯凯很理解我，也在我的饮食上帮了我很多。"

# game/script.rpy:147
translate chinese ep1_596c00cb:

    # yt "Anyway, let's just get going..."
    yt "总之，赶紧出发吧……"

# game/script.rpy:158
translate chinese ep1_b88666da:

    # l "Good morning, [mc!t]! You're always on time, as I expect from you."
    l "早上好，[mc!t]！你总是按时到岗，没一天落下的。"

# game/script.rpy:159
translate chinese ep1_eb6f9d77:

    # mc "Good morning, Lily!"
    mc "早上好，莉莉！"

# game/script.rpy:160
translate chinese ep1_00c7ced1:

    # yt "This is Lily. She's my co-worker here at the burger shack."
    yt "这个女生是莉莉。她是我在汉堡店的同事。"

# game/script.rpy:161
translate chinese ep1_b21faa17:

    # yt "But unlike me, she's still finishing her college degree."
    yt "但跟我不一样，她还在大学里念书。"

# game/script.rpy:162
translate chinese ep1_5a81190c:

    # yt "She works full time during the day and is taking just a couple of courses at night, so she doesn't exhaust herself."
    yt "她白天全职工作，晚上才会去上几节课，所以倒也不会累到自己。"

# game/script.rpy:163
translate chinese ep1_4b4b9966:

    # yt "Pretty smart thinking I'd say."
    yt "我认为她这办法还挺不错的。"

# game/script.rpy:164
translate chinese ep1_51ae7b26:

    # yt "I really admire her diligence. But at the same time, I feel sorry for her."
    yt "我很欣赏她的勤奋。但我也很同情她。"

# game/script.rpy:165
translate chinese ep1_92ecb93a:

    # yt "She told me that she lost both her parents in a car accident a few years ago and now lives on her own."
    yt "她之前跟我说她的父母都因为一场车祸去世了，她现在自己一个人生活。"

# game/script.rpy:166
translate chinese ep1_42aff823:

    # yt "I don't really have to think twice about helping her anyway I can."
    yt "所以我决定我会尽我所能帮助她。"

# game/script.rpy:167
translate chinese ep1_8ca6f5ee:

    # l "Come on, [mc!t]. Customers will start swarming this place soon."
    l "来吧，[mc!t]。客人们马上就要来了。"

# game/script.rpy:168
translate chinese ep1_b40719d3:

    # mc "Oh, sorry. I'll just change into my uniform."
    mc "哦，不好意思。我马上去换工作服。"

# game/script.rpy:174
translate chinese ep1_0cf7c79e:

    # "A few hours later..."
    "几个小时之后……"

# game/script.rpy:182
translate chinese ep1_7ddc7438:

    # mc "Here's your double cheeseburger and medium soda for take out. Please enjoy!"
    mc "这是您外带的双层芝士堡和中份可乐。请慢用！"

# game/script.rpy:183
translate chinese ep1_0d3646b8:

    # cu "Thanks!"
    cu "谢谢！"

# game/script.rpy:186
translate chinese ep1_ed11b517:

    # ass "I told you that I literally found a cockroach inside my burger, you bitch! What are you gonna do about it?!"
    ass "我都说了我在汉堡里吃到了一只蟑螂，贱货！你要怎么赔我？！"

# game/script.rpy:189
translate chinese ep1_d44af414:

    # l "Uhm. ahh... I'm really sorry sir. I..."
    l "嗯……啊……非常不好意思，先生。我……"

# game/script.rpy:190
translate chinese ep1_3a5e2b0e:

    # l "It's very unlikely for that to happen sir... I mean..."
    l "这种事情实在不太可能……请您……"

# game/script.rpy:191
translate chinese ep1_cd9cbceb:

    # ass "What kind of customer service does this place have?! The employees and the food here are like shit!"
    ass "你们这什么服务态度啊？！你们这店里不管是吃的还是服务员全都是垃圾！"

# game/script.rpy:192
translate chinese ep1_ab067307:

    # ass "What is the owner even thinking of hiring people like you?! You useless piece of shit!"
    ass "老板瞎了眼才找你来吧？！解决不了就给我滚蛋！"

# game/script.rpy:195
translate chinese ep1_c24eaec6:

    # yt "Then just don't eat here, you asshole!"
    yt "那你倒别在我们这吃啊，你个傻逼！"

# game/script.rpy:196
translate chinese ep1_fec30f30:

    # yt "This kind of customer isn't actually new here. This sort of thing happens pretty often. But I'm already used to it after all the time I've spent working here."
    yt "这种客人真的不少见。从我开始在这工作以来已经见过不少次这种情况了，所以我已经习惯了。"

# game/script.rpy:197
translate chinese ep1_0aa523cb:

    # yt "I'm not surprised that Lily doesn't have much experience dealing with this, since she's only worked here for 2 weeks."
    yt "莉莉应付不来这种客人倒也不奇怪，毕竟她才在这干了两个星期。"

# game/script.rpy:198
translate chinese ep1_910d34ce:

    # yt "Now, what do I do?"
    yt "我该怎么办？"

# game/script.rpy:204
translate chinese ep1_2a8b81f4:

    # mc "Good morning, sir. My name is [mc!t]. Can I ask what seems to be the problem?"
    mc "早上好，先生。我叫[mc!t]。您能给我说说您遇到了什么问题吗？"

# game/script.rpy:205
translate chinese ep1_e8dc7ad8:

    # ass "Well, I just told this bitch that I found a cockroach in my burger! Do you know how disgusting that shit is, huh?!"
    ass "我都说过几遍了，我在汉堡里面吃到了蟑螂！你知道这有多恶心人吗，你让我怎么继续吃饭啊，啊？！"

# game/script.rpy:206
translate chinese ep1_aad87767:

    # yt "Let me guess... This asshole probably just wants to trick us into giving him food without paying a single penny."
    yt "要我说……这个贱货就是想吃饭不给钱。"

# game/script.rpy:207
translate chinese ep1_fadc9265:

    # yt "Well, let's see."
    yt "走着瞧吧。"

# game/script.rpy:208
translate chinese ep1_792286e2:

    # mc "I apologize that you had to experience such a horrible thing, sir. However, can I please request that you show us the burger with the cockroach in it as you have said?"
    mc "非常抱歉让您有了如此糟糕的经历，先生。但是，在我为您解决问题之前，能请您给我看看那个有蟑螂的汉堡吗？"

# game/script.rpy:209
translate chinese ep1_13712a6e:

    # ass "I... threw it in the trash can of course!"
    ass "我……我早给扔垃圾桶里去了！"

# game/script.rpy:210
translate chinese ep1_e3d43e78:

    # yt "*chuckles* I knew it."
    yt "*笑* 我就知道。"

# game/script.rpy:211
translate chinese ep1_8dd1d9f6:

    # mc "It is not my duty and we are forbidden to open the garbage bins during work hours to maintain the hygiene of the place."
    mc "为了保持店内卫生整洁，上班期间我们是不允许打开垃圾桶的。而且我的职责也不包括清理垃圾。"

# game/script.rpy:212
translate chinese ep1_20355d78:

    # mc "However, I am willing to risk my job and check the garbage bin you threw it in."
    mc "然而，为了给您带来更良好的服务，我愿意违反规定去翻找那个您丢了汉堡的垃圾桶。"

# game/script.rpy:213
translate chinese ep1_41dc3a5d:

    # mc "If we can prove your experience, then we will be happy to compensate you however we can."
    mc "只要能证明您确实在我们店内遇到了如此糟糕的事件，我们会给您能力范围内最多的赔偿。"

# game/script.rpy:214
translate chinese ep1_dc1065a1:

    # mc "However... If such a thing never happened, we have the right to ban you from entering this place again for rudeness and interrupting business."
    mc "不过……如果您是在无理取闹，我们有权从此不再为您提供任何服务。"

# game/script.rpy:215
translate chinese ep1_96563885:

    # mc "As you can see, a lot of people are waiting to get their food. So you're not just inconveniencing us but the people who are waiting in line as well."
    mc "您也看到了，后面还有很多顾客排队等着取餐。您不仅是在为难我们，也给所有其他顾客带来了不便。"

# game/script.rpy:216
translate chinese ep1_653ac3e6:

    # mc "Furthermore, we have the highest food hygiene rating out of all the burger shacks in the entire town."
    mc "我还要告诉您，本店的卫生评级是全市所有汉堡店里最高的。"

# game/script.rpy:217
translate chinese ep1_cad5cab6:

    # mc "We're doing quality and hygiene checks every opening and closing of the place. So it is extremely unlikely for your experience to happen."
    mc "每天开店前与闭店后，我们都会进行详细、彻底的卫生检查。所以您所描述的事情实在是不太可能出现。"

# game/script.rpy:218
translate chinese ep1_a39447ca:

    # mc "But, I am not saying that you are wrong. I'll go ahead and check that bin now. Can you please tell me which bin you threw your food in?"
    mc "然而，我并没有说您在骗人的意思。我现在会去检查您刚刚提到的垃圾桶。可以请您告诉我您把汉堡扔到哪个垃圾桶里了吗？"

# game/script.rpy:219
translate chinese ep1_12c7d9e2:

    # ass "Uh... Eh... Uhm... Nevermind! I'll never come to this shitty place ever again! I'm going to make sure to leave a bad review of this place!"
    ass "啊……这……嗯……算了！我以后再也不会来你这家店吃了！我之后一定会给你们差评！"

# game/script.rpy:222
translate chinese ep1_2b24755d:

    # yt "Well... That took care of it."
