    s "哇……我的汉堡~！！"

# game/script.rpy:393
translate chinese ep1_9f339433:

    # s "Hihihi~ Thank you, [mc!t]. You're the best!"
    s "嘻嘻嘻~谢谢你，[mc!t]。你最好啦！"

# game/script.rpy:396
translate chinese ep1_8c4d5232_1:

    # "*kisses*"
    "*亲*"

# game/script.rpy:405
translate chinese ep1_1dabcf61:

    # mc "Y-you're welcome..."
    mc "不——不客气……"

# game/script.rpy:406
translate chinese ep1_e266bb82:

    # yt "Damn it! How can I forget about what happened that time if she keeps doing this?!"
    yt "操啊！她要是一直这样，我怎么可能忘掉那天发生的事？！"

# game/script.rpy:407
translate chinese ep1_9ae9e8c5:

    # yt "We both said it was just an accident but..."
    yt "我俩都说那只是个意外，可是……"

# game/script.rpy:411
translate chinese ep1_ea767a9b:

    # yt "...I don't really feel like it was."
    yt "……我怎么想都觉得不可能是意外。"

# game/script.rpy:414
translate chinese ep1_befad6ff:

    # s "By the way, [mc!t]. I got a call from [landlady!t] earlier."
    s "对了，[mc!t]，[landlady!t]之前给我打电话了。"

# game/script.rpy:415
translate chinese ep1_7094f3c1:

    # mc "Hm? What did she say? Did something bad happen?"
    mc "嗯？她说啥了？不会是坏事吧？"

# game/script.rpy:416
translate chinese ep1_c97d25a2:

    # s "No, you silly. It's nothing like that. She told me that she put the other rooms up for rent and the tenants will move in tomorrow morning."
    s "咋可能啊，笨蛋。根本不是坏事。她跟我说她把剩下的房间租出去了，明天早上就会有人搬来。"

# game/script.rpy:417
translate chinese ep1_6e7c45b3:

    # mc "Eh? What made her decide to put the rooms up for rent? She didn't have any desire to do that before."
    mc "啊？怎么这么突然？她以前从来没说过呀。"

# game/script.rpy:418
translate chinese ep1_9c13b8b5:

    # s "It was a good decision, to be honest. It's such a waste for the rooms to just stand empty accumulating dust."
    s "说实话，我觉得还挺不错的。那几个房间放着落灰多浪费呀。"

# game/script.rpy:419
translate chinese ep1_66332781:

    # s "She also told me that the rent money will go to the two of us, and it will really help us with upkeep and maintenance of the house."
    s "她还说租金全都给我们俩花，花剩下的就拿来保养维护房子。"

# game/script.rpy:420
translate chinese ep1_1cc24f5b:

    # mc "Do you have any idea who's moving in?"
    mc "你知道是谁要搬来住吗？"

# game/script.rpy:421
translate chinese ep1_0281fb6c:

    # s "Hmm... All [landlady!t] told me is that three girls are moving in tomorrow."
    s "嗯……[landlady!t]只跟我说是三个女生。"

# game/script.rpy:422
translate chinese ep1_e85cc7a0:

    # yt "Three girls? Why do I feel uneasy about this?"
    yt "三个女生？我怎么有种不祥的预感？"

# game/script.rpy:423
translate chinese ep1_821c7710:

    # mc "Do you know their names?"
    mc "还有呢？知道她们叫什么吗？"

# game/script.rpy:424
translate chinese ep1_0922cbb9:

    # s "Nope. She didn't give me any further information."
    s "没了。其他的她啥也没跟我说。"

# game/script.rpy:425
translate chinese ep1_d2be64c9:

    # mc "Oh... I see. So we should fix up the other rooms, right?"
    mc "哦……好吧。那我们得把那几个房间打扫一下了。"

# game/script.rpy:426
translate chinese ep1_2a863eb5:

    # s "Yep! You got it! We can do it now, if it's alright with you."
    s "对！说的没错！你愿意的话，我们现在就可以开始。"

# game/script.rpy:427
translate chinese ep1_39e0e9da:

    # mc "Yeah, sure. I'm not really very tired yet. It's also Saturday tomorrow which is my day off so..."
    mc "行啊，没问题。我现在也不累。而且正好明天也是周六，我休息……"

# game/script.rpy:428
translate chinese ep1_1aa414e5:

    # s "Great! Then, let's get it done."
    s "好嘞！那我们就开始干活吧。"

# game/script.rpy:456
translate chinese skypause_e408869d:

    # "After you finished fixing up the rooms, you and Sky ate dinner and went to bed..."
    "打扫完房间之后，你跟斯凯吃过晚饭就回房间睡觉了……"

# game/script.rpy:462
translate chinese skypause_07ebd3f6:

    # "Saturday morning..."
    "周六早上……"

# game/script.rpy:472
translate chinese skypause_3755c2a6:

    # "*doorbell rings*"
    "*门铃响起*"

# game/script.rpy:475
translate chinese skypause_407f038b:

    # yt "That's probably them..."
    yt "应该是她们来了……"

# game/script.rpy:476
translate chinese skypause_264cf984:

    # yt "Well? Time to meet our housemates, I guess."
    yt "好了，去见见新室友吧。"

# game/script.rpy:491
translate chinese skypause_7bb3e84c:

    # a "Good morning!"
    a "早上好！"

# game/script.rpy:492
translate chinese skypause_4228823d:

    # mc "Good morning! Are you guys-"
    mc "早上好！你们几个是——"

# game/script.rpy:493
translate chinese skypause_e24aa807:

    # yt "Wait... WHAT THE HELL??!!!"
    yt "等等啊……他妈的什么情况啊？？！！！"

# game/script.rpy:494
translate chinese skypause_67769aa6:

    # yt "Pink eyes with long black hair... And this face..."
    yt "粉色眼睛，黑色长发……还有这张脸……"

# game/script.rpy:495
translate chinese skypause_0db69b02:

    # yt "Aine??!!!"
    yt "是艾妮？？！！！"

# game/script.rpy:496
translate chinese skypause_d9e0af62:

    # yt "And these two are her friends -- Emma... and Gwen..."
    yt "这两个是她的朋友——艾玛……还有格温……"

# game/script.rpy:497
translate chinese skypause_f0b4b520:

    # yt "No wonder I felt uneasy when Sky told me that it's three girls who're moving in!"
    yt "我就说斯凯跟我说是三个女生搬来的时候我突然有种不祥的预感！"

# game/script.rpy:498
translate chinese skypause_9c3ebf8a:

    # yt "I had the terrible experience of being bullied by this girl back when I was in high school because of my physical appearance."
    yt "在我上高中的时候，因为我长得丑，这个女生把我霸凌得非常非常非常惨。"

# game/script.rpy:499
translate chinese skypause_66aac58d:

    # yt "I admit that I really looked pretty terrible back then. I was so fat and heavy that with a single step I could make the earth tremble."
    yt "我承认那个时候我确实长得很不好看。那时候我特别胖，走起路来大地都要颤抖。"

# game/script.rpy:500
translate chinese skypause_d7d11634:

    # yt "After I graduated high school, I got motivated and hit the gym. I also took a fighting class while I was at it."
    yt "高中毕业之后，我发愤图强，坚持去健身房锻炼。我还在那上了搏击课。"

# game/script.rpy:501
translate chinese skypause_0ced9adc:

    # yt "Still, it was not easy..."
    yt "健身减肥的日子，真的非常难熬……"

# game/script.rpy:502
translate chinese skypause_46f7ca7a:

    # yt "There were several times that I thought I was going to die because of how hard it was for me to workout with that hideous body of mine..."
    yt "我那么胖的体型，有好多次我都因为运动量过大差点当场暴毙……"

# game/script.rpy:503
translate chinese skypause_a4e34bc4:

    # yt "...until the thought of quitting that shit entered my mind."
    yt "……还有无数次我想就此放弃。"

# game/script.rpy:504
translate chinese skypause_17c157a0:

    # yt "However, I didn't let it faze me..."
    yt "但是，我最终还是坚持下来了……"

# game/script.rpy:505
translate chinese skypause_e70c2f3e:

    # yt "I pushed through heaven and hell just to change myself."
    yt "我为了改变自己付出了无数努力。"

# game/script.rpy:506
translate chinese skypause_e6d90107:

    # yt "After I finally achieved my desired result, I swore to myself that I would one day take revenge for everything Aine did to me, by making her fall for me and then dumping her the next time we meet."
    yt "减肥成功之后，我发誓一定要复仇，让艾妮付出代价，我要让她再见到我就爱上我，然后我再像扔掉破抹布一样甩了她。"

# game/script.rpy:507
translate chinese skypause_bb76ffac:

    # yt "It was the greatest revenge plan ever in the entire universe! HAHAHAHAHA!!"
    yt "绝对是全宇宙最伟大的复仇计划！哈哈哈哈哈哈！！"

# game/script.rpy:508
translate chinese skypause_d47ce133:

    # yt "However, I heard that she have become successful in life while I am just a nobody. Considering that, it was hard for me to take my revenge."
    yt "不过，之后我听说她的生活一帆风顺，非常成功，而我就是个小透明。考虑到这点，我的复仇计划很难成功。"

