    s "嗯……为什么你们要来住在我们这呢？"

# game/script.rpy:1128
translate chinese skyfirsttime_6bc97421:

    # s "Was it because of [mc!t]?"
    s "是因为[mc!t]吗？"

# game/script.rpy:1129
translate chinese skyfirsttime_26112a5a:

    # mc "Mmp! *cough* *cough* *cough*"
    mc "噗！ *咳嗽* *咳嗽* *咳嗽*"

# game/script.rpy:1130
translate chinese skyfirsttime_6e519aa8:

    # yt "Oh, damn! I forgot that Sky knew about my experiences!"
    yt "我去！都忘了斯凯也知道我过去那些事了！"

# game/script.rpy:1131
translate chinese skyfirsttime_ab9d5cc3:

    # yt "She probably knows that it's her!"
    yt "她可能已经认出来这些人了！"

# game/script.rpy:1134
translate chinese skyfirsttime_04e645b6:

    # e "{i}Delicious...{/i}"
    e "{i}真好吃……{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:1135
translate chinese skyfirsttime_5f97d41e:

    # a "Huh? What do you mean?"
    a "啊？什么意思？"

# game/script.rpy:1136
translate chinese skyfirsttime_3295f922:

    # s "Well, first of all, he's handsome. Second, he's got a good personality."
    s "嗯，首先呢，他很帅。再一个，他的性格也很好。"

# game/script.rpy:1137
translate chinese skyfirsttime_858faa62:

    # s "You guys might be looking for a boyfriend. *giggles*"
    s "很适合当你们的男朋友。 *笑*"

# game/script.rpy:1138
translate chinese skyfirsttime_866c0f03:

    # mc "*cough* *cough*"
    mc "*咳嗽* *咳嗽*"

# game/script.rpy:1139
translate chinese skyfirsttime_314ff4a3:

    # g "Do you need some water?"
    g "你要喝水吗？"

# game/script.rpy:1140
translate chinese skyfirsttime_11ad1167:

    # mc "N-no I'm fine. No worries."
    mc "没——没事。不用担心。"

# game/script.rpy:1141
translate chinese skyfirsttime_cf2070a0:

    # a "Uhh.. no! We didn't come here for that. And we didn't even know him until just today."
    a "呃……不！我们不是因为那个来的。而且我们今天才认识他。"

# game/script.rpy:1142
translate chinese skyfirsttime_388b00fe:

    # s "{i}Oh really? How come?{/i}"
    s "{i}真的吗？怎么可能？{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:1143
translate chinese skyfirsttime_b4bedea2:

    # s "*giggles* Relax I'm just kidding!"
    s "*笑* 我开玩笑的啦！"

# game/script.rpy:1144
translate chinese skyfirsttime_01f46057:

    # s "What do you guys do for a living though?"
    s "不过你们是做什么工作的呢？"

# game/script.rpy:1147
translate chinese skyfirsttime_41ffad47:

    # a "*sighs* That's actually the reason why we're here."
    a "*叹气* 那才是我们来这里的原因。"

# game/script.rpy:1148
translate chinese skyfirsttime_e01d1e4b:

    # a "Gwen and I lost our jobs, and we cannot afford our old apartment anymore."
    a "格温和我丢掉了工作，没法继续住在之前的房子里了。"

# game/script.rpy:1149
translate chinese skyfirsttime_c6474afa:

    # yt "Oh... I see they were living in the same place as usual."
    yt "哦……看来她们还是和以前一样住在一起。"

# game/script.rpy:1150
translate chinese skyfirsttime_e55b9a70:

    # yt "......"
    yt "......"

# game/script.rpy:1151
translate chinese skyfirsttime_fd952bee:

    # yt "Wait... what?!!"
    yt "等等……什么？！！"

# game/script.rpy:1152
translate chinese skyfirsttime_29a8564e:

    # yt "Lost their jobs... did Gwen lose her company too?!"
    yt "丢了工作……难道格温连她的公司都丢掉了吗？！"

# game/script.rpy:1155
translate chinese skyfirsttime_1c0d06c7:

    # g "Well, we could actually still afford it. But it's better to save what's left of our money until we can find new jobs."
    g "嗯，其实硬要说的话我们的钱还是够在那里继续住一段时间的。但在找到新工作之前最好还是把剩下的钱省着点花吧。"

# game/script.rpy:1156
translate chinese skyfirsttime_85f81bc8:

    # yt "Are you kidding me right now?!"
    yt "这是在跟我开玩笑吧？！"

# game/script.rpy:1157
translate chinese skyfirsttime_815e20ca:

    # yt "No no no. That's not you at all, Gwen!"
    yt "不可能，不可能啊。格温，你可从来不是这种人！"

# game/script.rpy:1158
translate chinese skyfirsttime_e55b9a70_1:

    # yt "......"
    yt "......"

# game/script.rpy:1159
translate chinese skyfirsttime_1c262c8b:

    # yt "Well... to be honest, it was a long time ago. And people do change."
    yt "不过……老实说，那都是很久之前的事了。人总是会变的。"

# game/script.rpy:1160
translate chinese skyfirsttime_42d8e653:

    # yt "However, I just can't imagine them changing at all. Possibly Gwen would."
    yt "不过，我怎么也想不到这三个人居然也会变。也就格温的可能性大点。"

# game/script.rpy:1161
translate chinese skyfirsttime_9d9729ce:

    # yt "Aine really is the main question here."
    yt "但艾妮才是问题的关键所在。"

# game/script.rpy:1162
translate chinese skyfirsttime_e020d459:

    # s "Then, how about Emma?"
    s "那，艾玛呢？"

# game/script.rpy:1165
translate chinese skyfirsttime_c3e6ac50:

    # a "Emma still has her job. You may not believe it, but she's a private investigator."
    a "艾玛还有工作。你们可能不信，但她其实是个私家侦探。"

# game/script.rpy:1166
translate chinese skyfirsttime_70c39315:

    # yt "Uh-oh..."
    yt "完蛋……"

# game/script.rpy:1167
translate chinese skyfirsttime_7b656fe3:

    # yt "I feel my life is on a countdown right now."
    yt "我觉得我的人生已经开始倒计时了。"

# game/script.rpy:1168
translate chinese skyfirsttime_c0e86d8b:

    # s "Oh, wow! That's amazing! How about you and Gwen?"
    s "天啊！那也太炫了！你呢，格温？"

# game/script.rpy:1169
translate chinese skyfirsttime_c6edf1f6:

    # a "I actually worked at Gwen's company. Which, unfortunately, had to close down due to certain circumstances."
    a "我其实是在格温的公司上班的。不幸的是，由于一些原因，公司只能关门了。"

# game/script.rpy:1170
translate chinese skyfirsttime_95afbce6:

    # a "It's a long story and Gwen probably doesn't want to talk about it right now."
    a "这件事说来话长，而且格温现在应该也不想谈。"

# game/script.rpy:1171
translate chinese skyfirsttime_6dc182a3:

    # g "Yeah, it's not that I don't trust you guys, but events are pretty confidential at the moment. So I'd like to keep it that way for now."
    g "是啊，并不是我不信任你们，只是这里面牵扯到一些机密。所以现在暂时就不要再谈了。"

# game/script.rpy:1172
translate chinese skyfirsttime_6a06eb43:

    # yt "So, is that the reason why Aine looked so down?"
    yt "艾妮就是因为这个才那么低落吗？"

# game/script.rpy:1173
translate chinese skyfirsttime_000e70a1:

    # s "Don't worry, I understand that kind of thing."
    s "没事的，我理解你。"

# game/script.rpy:1176
translate chinese skyfirsttime_58b16a52:

    # a "How about you two? What are you doing for a living?"
    a "你们两个呢？可以讲讲你们的工作吗？"

# game/script.rpy:1177
translate chinese skyfirsttime_582359ea:

    # mc "Hm?"
    mc "嗯？"

# game/script.rpy:1178
translate chinese skyfirsttime_062d28b0:

    # mc "My job is nothing compared to yours. I'm just working in a burger shack in midtown."
    mc "我的工作跟你们比不了。我在城里的一个汉堡店上班。"

# game/script.rpy:1179
translate chinese skyfirsttime_a5e3abfe:

    # mc "It's temporary, until I can find a decent job within my own field of study."
    mc "只是暂时的，我之后会找一个我专业领域的工作。"

# game/script.rpy:1180
translate chinese skyfirsttime_306e951e:

    # a "Hmm... It's still a job to be proud of. So chin up, [mc!t]."
    a "嗯……这依然是个值得骄傲的工作。不用泄气的，[mc!t]。"

# game/script.rpy:1181
translate chinese skyfirsttime_bfd5ef16:

    # yt "Are you really saying that to me right now?! I'm afraid that this is all just a weird dream, Aine."
    yt "她竟然会跟我说这种话？！我真害怕我现在只是在做梦，艾妮。"

# game/script.rpy:1182
translate chinese skyfirsttime_cd1b0cfe:

    # mc "Hehe. I'm fine with it. And I think it's actually better to have some work experience before applying for another job."
    mc "嘿嘿。我对这份工作很满意。而且我觉得积累些经验对我找下一个工作也有好处。"

# game/script.rpy:1183
translate chinese skyfirsttime_57b0e74f:

    # g "That's true! That's a good mindset, [mc!t]!"
    g "说的很对！你的想法很不错哦，[mc!t]！"

# game/script.rpy:1184
translate chinese skyfirsttime_6d04953c:

    # mc "Thanks!"
    mc "谢谢！"

# game/script.rpy:1187
translate chinese skyfirsttime_ffce2012:

    # s "And I'm just working here at home."
    s "我是在家里上班的。"

# game/script.rpy:1188
translate chinese skyfirsttime_d7076bad:

    # s "I'm an online teacher to foreign kids. It's pretty stressful to be honest. But I'm still enjoying it since I really like this job."
    s "我给外国小孩做在线教学。说实话压力挺大的。但我很喜欢这个工作，所以我还是很享受的。"

# game/script.rpy:1189
translate chinese skyfirsttime_3f6e050b:

    # s "You can say that it is my passion. Hehehe~"
    s "这算是我的热爱所在吧。嘿嘿嘿~"

# game/script.rpy:1192
translate chinese skyfirsttime_2c31cff0:

    # a "Really? I also worked as an online teacher for a couple of months before I started working for Gwen!"
    a "真的吗？我在给格温工作之前也做过几个月的线上老师！"

# game/script.rpy:1193
translate chinese skyfirsttime_a8f1f7d3:

    # a "I really liked it, but I still had to pursue something within my own field of study like what [mc!t] said."
    a "我很喜欢，但就像[mc!t]说的那样我还是要回归到我自己的专业领域去。"

# game/script.rpy:1194
translate chinese skyfirsttime_12cb7f10:

    # s "I totally agree with you."
    s "我完全同意你的说法。"

# game/script.rpy:1195
translate chinese skyfirsttime_522fa6bf:

    # s "Oh, I'm sorry to duck out of our conversation here. I need to go back upstairs to teach some classes at 1pm."
    s "噢，不好意思，我得先走一步了。我1点钟还有课。"

# game/script.rpy:1198
translate chinese skyfirsttime_d1a17c0a:

    # mc "I'll wash the dishes, Sky."
    mc "我来洗碗吧，斯凯。"

# game/script.rpy:1199
translate chinese skyfirsttime_9e04ae0d:

    # s "Thanks, [mc!t]. I'll be going right now. I'll see you later!"
    s "谢谢，[mc!t]。那我先走了。待会见！"

# game/script.rpy:1207
translate chinese skyfirsttime_e44923e8:

    # a "Let me help you, [mc!t]."
    a "我来帮你吧，[mc!t]。"

# game/script.rpy:1208
translate chinese skyfirsttime_7e05fc1f:

    # mc "It's alright, I can handle it."
    mc "没事的，我自己就可以。"

# game/script.rpy:1209
translate chinese skyfirsttime_fc6b0702:

    # a "No, I insist. Since we're living here now, we should be helping you guys with at least some of the chores."
    a "我真的也得搭把手。既然我们都住在一起了，那做点家务也是理所应当的。"

# game/script.rpy:1210
translate chinese skyfirsttime_4cf8d548:

    # mc "Hm... Alright."
    mc "嗯……好吧。"

# game/script.rpy:1211
translate chinese skyfirsttime_ce4c86e5:

    # mc "I'll wash the dishes, why don't you dry them and put them away."
    mc "我来洗碗吧，之后你把它们擦干再放回去就好了。"

# game/script.rpy:1212
translate chinese skyfirsttime_46c17595:

    # a "Sure!"
    a "好的！"

# game/script.rpy:1220
translate chinese skyfirsttime_063abb62:

    # mc "Aine?"
    mc "艾妮？"

# game/script.rpy:1221
translate chinese skyfirsttime_9343a7af:

    # a "Hm? Yes?"
    a "嗯？怎么了？"

# game/script.rpy:1222
translate chinese skyfirsttime_be9161c2:

    # mc "Can I ask you something?"
    mc "我能问你几个问题吗？"

# game/script.rpy:1225
translate chinese skyfirsttime_52710ef6:

    # a "That will depend on the question. *giggles*"
    a "那就要看你具体问的是什么了。 *笑*"

# game/script.rpy:1226
translate chinese skyfirsttime_1437dfa5:

    # yt "That smile... I can definitely sense a lot of sadness and worry in it."
    yt "她的微笑……里面隐藏着深深的悲伤和担忧。"

# game/script.rpy:1227
translate chinese skyfirsttime_e185ab4f:

    # mc "Was losing your job the reason why you look sad earlier?"
    mc "你之前是因为失业才显得那么伤心的吗？"

# game/script.rpy:1230
translate chinese skyfirsttime_d849f5c7:

    # a "Oh..."
    a "我……"

# game/script.rpy:1231
translate chinese skyfirsttime_588abb4b:

    # mc "Ahh... Ehh... You don't have to answer it if that makes you uncomfortable."
    mc "啊……嗯……你不用回答我也可以的。"

# game/script.rpy:1240
translate chinese skyfirsttime_842a4690:

    # a "*sighs* Alright, I'll tell you. However, you need to promise me that you won't tell anyone about it, okay? Even Sky."
    a "*叹气* 好吧，我可以告诉你。但你得保证不会告诉别人，知道吗？哪怕是斯凯也不行。"

# game/script.rpy:1241
translate chinese skyfirsttime_3b157da7:

    # mc "Sure, I promise. I'm a man of my word."
    mc "好啊，我保证。我一向说到做到。"

# game/script.rpy:1242
translate chinese skyfirsttime_732a8756:

    # a "......"
    a "……"

# game/script.rpy:1243
translate chinese skyfirsttime_aca913b4:

    # a "My parents..."
    a "我的父母……"

# game/script.rpy:1244
translate chinese skyfirsttime_2577d378:

    # mc "Hm? What about your parents?"
    mc "他们干什么了？"

# game/script.rpy:1245
translate chinese skyfirsttime_0da58ce5:

    # a "*sighs*...They set me up in an arranged marriage."
    a "*叹气* ……他们给我安排了一个包办婚姻。"

# game/script.rpy:1246
translate chinese skyfirsttime_8e714adf:

    # mc "WHAT?!!"
    mc "什么？！！"

# game/script.rpy:1255
translate chinese skyfirsttime_44102cb0:

    # a "*whispers* Shhhhh~ Be quiet!"
    a "*低语* 嘘~~~！小声点！"

# game/script.rpy:1256
translate chinese skyfirsttime_b3223ecd:

    # a "*whispers* I trusted you with my secret!"
    a "*低语* 我在跟你说我的秘密呢！"

# game/script.rpy:1257
translate chinese skyfirsttime_00b0f466:

    # a "{i}But... I don't know why I trusted him with it. I actually don't feel that this is the first time that we've met.{/i}"
    a "{i}但是……我也不知道为什么我会跟他说。我甚至感觉我们之前就已经认识了。{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:1258
translate chinese skyfirsttime_043c284c:

    # a "{i}I felt it when we arrived earlier.{/i}"
    a "{i}我之前刚来的时候就有这种感觉了。{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:1259
translate chinese skyfirsttime_7551553c:

    # a "{i}Strange...{/i}"
    a "{i}真奇怪……{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:1260
translate chinese skyfirsttime_c99ec186:

    # mc "Oh, I'm sorry, I didn't mean to suddenly shout."
    mc "真的不好意思，艾妮，我不是故意大喊的。"

# game/script.rpy:1263
translate chinese skyfirsttime_73a31d14:

    # a "Jeez..."
    a "你啊……"

# game/script.rpy:1264
translate chinese skyfirsttime_765db5b2:

    # mc "But, how come? I mean... Why did they set you up in an arranged marriage?"
    mc "可是，为什么啊？为什么他们要这么对你？"

# game/script.rpy:1265
translate chinese skyfirsttime_66740d24:

    # a "That's all I can tell you for now. Sorry."
    a "我现在只能告诉你这么多了。对不起。"

# game/script.rpy:1266
translate chinese skyfirsttime_86ee4585:

    # mc "That's alright. Thank you for trusting me with your secret though."
    mc "没关系。谢谢你能跟我分享你的秘密。"

# game/script.rpy:1269
translate chinese skyfirsttime_70f8ee9c:

    # a "Remember, not a word to anyone, okay?"
    a "记住了，一个字也不准告诉其他人啊，好吗？"

# game/script.rpy:1270
translate chinese skyfirsttime_f66b1417:

    # mc "I promised and I'll keep my word."
    mc "我保证，我一定说到做到。"

# game/script.rpy:1276
translate chinese skyfirsttime_b48fdd6e:

    # "Late that night..."
    "那天晚上……"

# game/script.rpy:1284
translate chinese skyfirsttime_95ccdd6a:

    # yt "Aine stuck in an arranged marriage, huh?"
    yt "艾妮被父母安排了结婚对象……"

# game/script.rpy:1285
translate chinese skyfirsttime_56af687c:

    # yt "Now I see why she looked so depressed earlier."
    yt "怪不得她之前看起来那么低落。"

# game/script.rpy:1286
translate chinese skyfirsttime_6b6c5175:

    # yt "She must be against it for her to look that way."
    yt "她既然变成现在这个样子，证明她肯定是不喜欢那个人的。"

# game/script.rpy:1287
translate chinese skyfirsttime_d9160fce:

    # yt "But I still wonder about her personality though..."
    yt "但是我还是对她现在的性格感到奇怪……"

# game/script.rpy:1288
translate chinese skyfirsttime_a8031aa9:

    # yt "An arranged marriage couldn't be the reason she changed, right?"
    yt "她不可能就因为这事就变了那么多，对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:1291
translate chinese skyfirsttime_d89431a6:

    # e "Hey there, 'Piggy'..."
    e "干嘛呢，猪头？"

# game/script.rpy:1294
translate chinese skyfirsttime_2a5e7f4d:

    # yt "God damn! That monotonous voice really sends shivers down my spine!"
    yt "他妈的！这冷冰冰的声音差点吓死我！"

# game/script.rpy:1295
translate chinese skyfirsttime_32e0c2aa:

    # yt "Wait, what did she call me?!"
    yt "等等，她刚刚喊我什么？！"

# game/script.rpy:1298
translate chinese skyfirsttime_4d4b0f41:

    # mc "What did you just call me?!"
    mc "你刚刚喊我喊的什么！？"

# game/script.rpy:1299
translate chinese skyfirsttime_0c6e20d4:

    # e "I know it's you, Piggy. Don't play dumb with me."
    e "我知道是你，猪头。别跟我装傻。"

# game/script.rpy:1300
translate chinese skyfirsttime_534e1379:

    # mc "I am not! So, you knew all along that it's me?!"
    mc "我没有！你早就认出来我了！？"

# game/script.rpy:1301
translate chinese skyfirsttime_118adec5:

    # e "Yes."
    e "是。"

# game/script.rpy:1302
translate chinese skyfirsttime_9bd5856f:

    # mc "Then, why are you here?! Are you going to order me around like what you and Aine did back then?!"
    mc "那你来找我干嘛？！你又想像以前那样对我吆五喝六的吗？！"

# game/script.rpy:1303
translate chinese skyfirsttime_879634cc:

    # e "No."
    e "不。"

# game/script.rpy:1304
translate chinese skyfirsttime_bda79f66:

    # mc "Then why come and move in here?!"
    mc "那你们干嘛搬来我家？！"

# game/script.rpy:1305
translate chinese skyfirsttime_388db59b:

    # e "Help."
    e "帮忙。"

# game/script.rpy:1306
translate chinese skyfirsttime_5e9fe091:

    # mc "......."
    mc "…………"

# game/script.rpy:1307
translate chinese skyfirsttime_fb633f17:

    # mc "Are you a robot or what?"
    mc "你是个机器人吗？"

# game/script.rpy:1308
translate chinese skyfirsttime_e49a91c0:

    # mc "Could you please answer me in a complete sentence? Aine has changed, but you're still the same as before, you psycho woman!"
    mc "你能用一句完整的话回答我吗？艾妮变了不少，但你还是跟以前一样，你个疯女人！"

# game/script.rpy:1317
translate chinese skyfirsttime_d99e7b33:

    # e "Change? I don't see any problem with the way I am right now."
    e "变了？我不觉得我现在这样有什么问题。"

# game/script.rpy:1318
translate chinese skyfirsttime_d66af7a6:

    # mc "There is definitely a problem!"
    mc "肯定有问题啊！"

# game/script.rpy:1319
translate chinese skyfirsttime_7ea92b37:

    # e "Aine, changed? You just misunderstood her, Piggy."
    e "艾妮，变了？你看错她了，猪头。"

# game/script.rpy:1320
translate chinese skyfirsttime_c782a402:

    # mc "Huh?! What do you mean I misunderstood her? With all the things she did to me back then?"
    mc "啊？！你什么意思？她以前跟现在的对比还不能说明她变了吗？"

# game/script.rpy:1321
translate chinese skyfirsttime_5b9f96dd:

    # mc "How could I misunderstand her?"
    mc "我怎么可能错看她？"

# game/script.rpy:1322
translate chinese skyfirsttime_10bd8d7b:

    # e "The Aine that you're seeing right now is her real personality."
    e "你现在看到的艾妮才是真正的艾妮。"

# game/script.rpy:1323
translate chinese skyfirsttime_fcb9cb33:

    # e "She didn't change, Piggy."
    e "她一点也没变，猪头。"

# game/script.rpy:1324
translate chinese skyfirsttime_4f76df7a:

    # mc "Could you please stop calling me that already?!"
    mc "你能不能别那么叫我了啊？！"

# game/script.rpy:1325
translate chinese skyfirsttime_879634cc_1:

    # e "No."
    e "不。"

# game/script.rpy:1326
translate chinese skyfirsttime_809a41ce:

    # mc "Uhh... Could you please show me some emotion?"
    mc "我真服了……你能有哪怕一点点感情吗？"

# game/script.rpy:1327
translate chinese skyfirsttime_7461d1e7:

    # e "Unnecessary."
    e "没必要。"

# game/script.rpy:1328
translate chinese skyfirsttime_13fa4bdb:

    # mc "Ehh... Bummer."
    mc "呃……烦人。"

# game/script.rpy:1329
translate chinese skyfirsttime_0c8ed314:

    # mc "But... What do you mean, her real personality?"
    mc "不过……你刚刚说真正的艾妮是什么意思？"

# game/script.rpy:1330
translate chinese skyfirsttime_1acbd09a:

    # e "Just what the words say, Piggy."
    e "就是字面意思，猪头。"

# game/script.rpy:1331
translate chinese skyfirsttime_4a566d70:

    # e "She didn't change. What she was showing to everyone back then was just her camouflage."
    e "她没变。她以前在你面前的一切都是装的。"

# game/script.rpy:1332
translate chinese skyfirsttime_22270933:

    # mc "Camouflage?"
    mc "装的？"

# game/script.rpy:1333
translate chinese skyfirsttime_118adec5_1:

    # e "Yes."
    e "是。"

# game/script.rpy:1334
translate chinese skyfirsttime_4c3d97c8:

    # e "She did it to hide her emotions away."
    e "她只能装成别人来隐藏自己的情绪。"

# game/script.rpy:1335
translate chinese skyfirsttime_79a57fc7:

    # mc "Hide her emotions? You're not making any sense, Emma."
    mc "隐藏情绪？你这话说得狗屁不通，艾玛。"

# game/script.rpy:1336
translate chinese skyfirsttime_d73ebd50:

    # mc "How are bullying me and hurting every guy's feelings supposed to hide her emotions?!"
    mc "每天霸凌我还有羞辱别的男生跟隐藏情绪有什么关系？！"

# game/script.rpy:1337
translate chinese skyfirsttime_fb3df604:

    # e "I'll leave that to you to discover."
    e "这就靠你自己去发现了。"

# game/script.rpy:1338
translate chinese skyfirsttime_20a585b7:

    # e "But the real Aine is really gentle and kind."
    e "但真正的艾妮就是温柔又和善的。"

# game/script.rpy:1339
translate chinese skyfirsttime_d0adf8af:

    # mc "I wish I could believe that, but..."
    mc "这怎么可能……"

# game/script.rpy:1340
translate chinese skyfirsttime_b7f609ec:

    # e "You saw it yourself, right?"
    e "你自己也看见了，不是吗？"

# game/script.rpy:1341
translate chinese skyfirsttime_fa0f1c7d:

    # e "At the stairs... and in the kitchen."
    e "在楼梯上……还有在厨房里。"

# game/script.rpy:1342
translate chinese skyfirsttime_2634dddd:

    # mc "You were spying on me?!"
    mc "你一直在偷窥我？！"

# game/script.rpy:1343
translate chinese skyfirsttime_118adec5_2:

    # e "Yes."
    e "是。"

# game/script.rpy:1344
translate chinese skyfirsttime_24b25b0f:

    # mc "*sighs*"
    mc "*叹气*"

# game/script.rpy:1345
translate chinese skyfirsttime_6790c6bd:

    # yt "I don't want to believe her, but now that I've interacted with Aine, she's actually right."
    yt "我不想相信她，但在跟艾妮交流过之后，她好像确实没有骗我。"

# game/script.rpy:1346
translate chinese skyfirsttime_9ae66cab:

    # mc "Alright, let's say that I believe you."
    mc "好吧，先假设我相信你了。"

# game/script.rpy:1347
translate chinese skyfirsttime_3dd9055b:

    # mc "But why does she not even recognize me?"
    mc "那为什么她都没认出来我？"

# game/script.rpy:1348
translate chinese skyfirsttime_b83fc180:

    # e "That's simple."
    e "很简单。"

# game/script.rpy:1349
translate chinese skyfirsttime_4d529045:

    # e "She already forgot about you."
    e "她已经把你忘了。"

# game/script.rpy:1350
translate chinese skyfirsttime_812a3612:

    # e "Not just her, Gwen forgot about you, too."
    e "不只是她，格温也忘了你的事了。"

# game/script.rpy:1351
translate chinese skyfirsttime_ef34af6c:

    # e "And you've changed a lot physically."
    e "而且你的外表变化也非常大。"

# game/script.rpy:1352
translate chinese skyfirsttime_7de6b529:

    # mc "After everything they did to me?!"
    mc "她们那时候那么对我，现在居然把我忘了！？"

# game/script.rpy:1353
translate chinese skyfirsttime_9116fe1c:

    # e "Gwen didn't hurt you back then, did she?"
    e "格温那时候没对你做什么坏事吧？"

# game/script.rpy:1354
translate chinese skyfirsttime_70e513e1:

    # mc "No! But she..."
    mc "是没有！但是她……"

# game/script.rpy:1355
translate chinese skyfirsttime_0fba19b8:

    # e "Hm?"
    e "嗯？"

# game/script.rpy:1356
translate chinese skyfirsttime_1d7ad725:

    # mc "Nevermind."
    mc "算了。"

# game/script.rpy:1357
translate chinese skyfirsttime_92520235:

    # e "Time flies, Piggy. As the days and years go by, people forget about things and people change."
    e "光阴似箭啊，猪头。时间流逝，人就是会遗忘和改变的。"

# game/script.rpy:1358
translate chinese skyfirsttime_5b4e356a:

    # e "You know that, right?"
    e "你也很清楚吧？"

# game/script.rpy:1359
translate chinese skyfirsttime_d5fb492a:

    # e "I know you're not an idiot."
    e "我知道你不是个傻子。"

# game/script.rpy:1360
translate chinese skyfirsttime_bda3f344:

    # mc "Did you just sort of praise me?"
    mc "你这算是在夸我吗？"

# game/script.rpy:1361
translate chinese skyfirsttime_67d60109:

    # e "I don't have a problem with you. I was just doing what Aine told me to do. I'm her servant after all."
    e "我个人并不讨厌你。我那时候只是在做艾妮命令我做的事。毕竟我是她的仆人。"

# game/script.rpy:1362
translate chinese skyfirsttime_32a826af:

    # mc "So I was actually right about you being her servant. *chuckles*"
    mc "那看来我猜的还真没错。 *笑*"

# game/script.rpy:1363
translate chinese skyfirsttime_d1b3dd2c:

    # e "You may not know this, but Aine is from a rich family with a well-known name."
    e "你可能不知道，艾妮其实是一个很出名、很有钱的家族的大小姐。"

# game/script.rpy:1364
translate chinese skyfirsttime_82723df9:

    # e "I was appointed by her parents to serve her, as members of my family have done for generations."
    e "她的父母指派我去服侍她，这也是我的家族数代以来的传统。"

# game/script.rpy:1365
translate chinese skyfirsttime_347d1a34:

    # e "My family are loyal servants to Aine's family."
    e "我的家族就是艾妮的家族的忠实仆人。"

# game/script.rpy:1366
translate chinese skyfirsttime_17a2b927:

    # mc "Jeez! I never thought of Aine having a family like that!"
    mc "天啊！我从来不知道艾妮还有这样的家庭背景！"

# game/script.rpy:1367
translate chinese skyfirsttime_23a53338:

    # mc "If she has that kind of family, why does she still have to work?"
    mc "她都是这种级别的人了，怎么还要上班呢？"

# game/script.rpy:1368
translate chinese skyfirsttime_d95e3b0a:

    # e "Aine never liked how her family does things. She might have lived in a mansion with the power to get anything she wanted, but she was like a prisoner in there."
    e "艾妮一点也不喜欢她的家族的行事风格。她或许住在大宅子里，想要什么就有什么，但她其实只是被关在家里的囚徒。"

# game/script.rpy:1369
translate chinese skyfirsttime_cec8757d:

    # e "She's had no right to decide what she wanted to do with her own life."
    e "她对自己的人生没有一丝话语权。"

# game/script.rpy:1370
translate chinese skyfirsttime_5211f8f1:

    # e "Even though she's a daughter of a rich family, she has no say in her own future."
    e "尽管是富贵人家的大小姐，却不能决定自己的未来。"

# game/script.rpy:1371
translate chinese skyfirsttime_0635b02c:

    # e "So, when she finished her college degree, she decided to move out of that place. As her servant, I must be always by her side."
    e "所以，在大学毕业以后，她决定跟家里一刀两断。作为她的仆人，我必须时刻伴她左右。"

# game/script.rpy:1372
translate chinese skyfirsttime_6e0ffeec:

    # mc "So she's basically a run-away child, huh?"
    mc "所以她算是离家出走了？"

# game/script.rpy:1373
translate chinese skyfirsttime_ca4b7d8e:

    # e "Not really."
    e "倒也不是。"

# game/script.rpy:1374
translate chinese skyfirsttime_e91bd0fa:

    # e "Her family agreed to it."
    e "她家里同意她这么做。"

# game/script.rpy:1375
translate chinese skyfirsttime_7ff31082:

    # e "But even now that she's left that house, and thought she was finally free of her family's shackles, things are still the same."
    e "尽管她离开了家，以为自己再也不会被父母束缚，但其实什么都没变。"

# game/script.rpy:1376
translate chinese skyfirsttime_efd7f642:

    # mc "And now she is being set up for an arranged marriage..."
    mc "现在她还被父母安排了包办婚姻……"

# game/script.rpy:1377
translate chinese skyfirsttime_2ab600da:

    # e "That's right. And that's also where you come in."
    e "是的。这时候就轮到你出场了。"

# game/script.rpy:1378
translate chinese skyfirsttime_085722e2:

    # mc "What?!"
    mc "什么？！？！？！？！"

# game/script.rpy:1379
translate chinese skyfirsttime_c810705f:

    # mc "What part can I possibly have in her and her family's problems?"
    mc "她和她家里的事情，跟我有什么关系？"

# game/script.rpy:1380
translate chinese skyfirsttime_0047c36e:

    # e "You were part of it from the moment you confessed to Aine, Piggy."
    e "自从你向她表白之后，就跟你有关系了，猪头。"

# game/script.rpy:1381
translate chinese skyfirsttime_fe0df49c:

    # e "It wasn't a coincidence that we chose to live here."
    e "我们住进你家不是巧合。"

# game/script.rpy:1382
translate chinese skyfirsttime_ce973f0f:

    # e "I set it all up."
    e "是我安排的。"

# game/script.rpy:1383
translate chinese skyfirsttime_28473912:

    # e "I tracked you down and found where you lived."
    e "我找到了你的住址。"

# game/script.rpy:1384
translate chinese skyfirsttime_8b0fe041:

    # e "I was the one who convinced your [landlady!t] to put the other rooms in the house up for rent."
    e "然后我说服了你的[landlady!t]让我们住进这里。"

# game/script.rpy:1385
translate chinese skyfirsttime_0542b4a2:

    # mc "Wait a minute. How did you even know my [landlady!t]?"
    mc "你等等啊。你怎么认识我[landlady!t]的？"

# game/script.rpy:1386
translate chinese skyfirsttime_dfb6b2f1:

    # e "It doesn't matter."
    e "那不重要。"

# game/script.rpy:1387
translate chinese skyfirsttime_e2b197af:

    # e "I was also lucky that Gwen's company closed down."
    e "幸运的是格温的公司也碰巧倒闭了。"

# game/script.rpy:1388
translate chinese skyfirsttime_524bb21d:

    # e "That made it easier for us to move here."
    e "所以我们有更充分的理由搬过来了。"

# game/script.rpy:1389
translate chinese skyfirsttime_6c77a321:

    # mc "Your friend just lost her company and you call that lucky?!"
    mc "你的朋友的公司倒闭了，你竟然说“幸运”？！"

# game/script.rpy:1390
translate chinese skyfirsttime_4d8e7ac0:

    # e "Gwen is my friend, but I only care about Aine's welfare. I only have one purpose in life, and that's to serve her until I die."
    e "格温确实是我的朋友，但我只在乎艾妮。我的人生只有一个目的，那就是服侍艾妮直到我死去。"

# game/script.rpy:1391
translate chinese skyfirsttime_700da5c5:

    # e "And even if Gwen's company hadn't closed down I would still have found a way to come here and ask for your help."
    e "而且即使格温的公司没有出事，我也会想个办法来这找你帮忙的。"

# game/script.rpy:1392
translate chinese skyfirsttime_4d8298ff:

    # mc "You're telling me all of this, but I still can't see what 'help' you want from me, Emma."
    mc "你跟我说了这么多，我还是根本不知道我能帮上什么，艾玛。"

# game/script.rpy:1393
translate chinese skyfirsttime_4a2dc126:

    # e "I know that you liked Aine and I know that you're a good guy..."
    e "我知道你喜欢艾妮，我也知道你是个好人……"

# game/script.rpy:1394
translate chinese skyfirsttime_110ca8b4:

    # mc "There you go praising me again. It really creeps me out!"
    mc "你又开始夸我了。真的很吓人！"

# game/script.rpy:1395
translate chinese skyfirsttime_2cf627fd:

    # mc "Yeah... I liked Aine before, but what does that matter?"
    mc "对……我以前是喜欢过艾妮，那又怎样？"

# game/script.rpy:1396
translate chinese skyfirsttime_4b534b31:

    # e "I want to save Aine. You're going to help me and you don't have any choice. Even if you turn me down, I will still bug you until you say yes."
    e "我想救艾妮。你必须帮我，没有其他选择。即使你现在拒绝我，我也会每天来找你，直到你同意为止。"

# game/script.rpy:1397
translate chinese skyfirsttime_1c2e3bd9:

    # mc "Yeah, yeah... I know you. Just tell me already."
    mc "行行行……我还不知道你什么样吗。你赶紧说就是了。"

# game/script.rpy:1398
translate chinese skyfirsttime_136cff15:

    # e "I know this is unfair to you, so I'm going to ask you with all my heart."
    e "我知道这件事对你来说很不公平，所以我发自内心地请求你。"

# game/script.rpy:1401
translate chinese skyfirsttime_ad6e165b:

    # e "......"
    e "…………"

# game/script.rpy:1404
translate chinese skyfirsttime_c9cde0c5:

    # e ".........."
    e "………………"

# game/script.rpy:1407
translate chinese skyfirsttime_20dbdf5c:

    # e "Please, [mc!t]~"
    e "拜托你，[mc!t]~"

# game/script.rpy:1408
translate chinese skyfirsttime_04d30538:

    # yt "Did her voice just..."
    yt "她的声音是不是……"

# game/script.rpy:1409
translate chinese skyfirsttime_92dc7f05:

    # e "Please marry Aine~"
    e "请你跟艾妮结婚吧~"

# game/script.rpy:1446
translate chinese emmapause_30d5af00:

    # mc "Oh, yeah! Su-"
    mc "哦，好呀！肯定可——"

# game/script.rpy:1447
translate chinese emmapause_4d8996ad:

    # mc "Wait..."
    mc "不是……"

# game/script.rpy:1448
translate chinese emmapause_9cb1b963:

    # mc "WHAT THE HECK DID YOU JUST SAY?!"
    mc "你说什么玩意儿？！"

# game/script.rpy:1449
translate chinese emmapause_db4bd320:

    # e "I want you to marry Aine."
    e "我想让你跟艾妮结婚。"

# game/script.rpy:1450
translate chinese emmapause_bbf2e6d4:

    # mc "Hold on... Do you even know what you're talking about, Emma?"
    mc "打住……你知道你在说什么吗，艾玛？"

# game/script.rpy:1451
translate chinese emmapause_7cff1254:

    # mc "Marry Aine?!"
    mc "跟她结婚？！"

# game/script.rpy:1452
translate chinese emmapause_1b5fc7a6:

    # mc "Me? Marrying the girl who bullied me during highschool?! That's the most ridiculous idea I've heard in my entire life, you know that?!"
    mc "我？跟高中一直霸凌我的女生结婚？！这是我长这么大听到的最扯淡的事了，你知道吗！？"

# game/script.rpy:1453
translate chinese emmapause_b8c59750:

    # mc "Please tell me you're just kidding. Hahahahahaha~!"
    mc "你肯定是在逗我玩呢吧，哈哈哈哈哈哈~！"

# game/script.rpy:1454
translate chinese emmapause_1e4d9da1:

    # e "No, I'm serious, Piggy."
    e "我现在非常认真，猪头。"

# game/script.rpy:1455
translate chinese emmapause_507f83a6:

    # mc "Ha..."
    mc "哈……"

# game/script.rpy:1456
translate chinese emmapause_f886a189:

    # mc "You're really serious about it?! But..."
    mc "你真的没在开玩笑？！可是……"

# game/script.rpy:1457
translate chinese emmapause_5c011817:

    # mc "...why me?! There are a lot of people out there who have a lot more potential to be her husband! I'm just a nobody, Emma!"
    mc "……为什么是我？！这世界上更适合做她老公的男人多了去了！我就是个普通人，艾玛！"

# game/script.rpy:1458
translate chinese emmapause_712bffc7:

    # mc "I'm just a plain dude working in a burger shack, trying to get by in his daily life!"
    mc "我就是个在汉堡店打工的小透明，只想过点平凡日子！"

# game/script.rpy:1459
translate chinese emmapause_bf9644a9:

    # mc "If I ever agree to that ridiculous idea and disregard everything she did before, what can I even offer her?!"
    mc "即使我无视她以前做过的一切，同意这个扯天下之大淡的要求，我又能给她什么？！"

# game/script.rpy:1460
translate chinese emmapause_9c492ac8:

    # mc "My abs? My triceps? My handsome face?"
    mc "我的腹肌？还是肱三头肌？难道是我这张帅脸？"

# game/script.rpy:1461
translate chinese emmapause_ad6e165b:

    # e "......"
    e "…………"

# game/script.rpy:1462
translate chinese emmapause_f066b647:

    # mc "If her family is like you've said, what can I even do for her?"
    mc "要是她家里真的像你说的那样，我能怎么帮她？"

# game/script.rpy:1463
translate chinese emmapause_137e3134:

    # mc "I don't have the power to do things!"
    mc "我没有那种能力！"

# game/script.rpy:1464
translate chinese emmapause_ef85f80a:

    # e "The fact that you're a nobody right now is the reason it has to be you."
    e "就是因为现在你什么也不是，才必须是你。"

# game/script.rpy:1465
translate chinese emmapause_358748bf:

    # e "I plan to hide Aine after you get married. You don't have a name in industry or commerce, so it will be hard for her family to find her."
    e "我打算在你们结婚之后把艾妮藏起来。你在商界和各种行当里都默默无闻，所以她的家人更不容易找到她。"

# game/script.rpy:1466
translate chinese emmapause_0d10468e:

    # mc "Is that the whole reason? That doesn't seem like enough, Emma!"
    mc "就这？这可不是什么让人信服的理由，艾玛！"

# game/script.rpy:1467
translate chinese emmapause_879634cc:

    # e "No."
    e "确实。"

# game/script.rpy:1468
translate chinese emmapause_1bca24b7:

    # e "I know that you liked Aine before. She used to order you around, but you're a guy and you could have chosen to refuse her."
    e "我知道你以前喜欢艾妮。虽然她把你当奴隶使唤，但你明明可以反抗，却什么也没做。"

# game/script.rpy:1469
translate chinese emmapause_ec1b0705:

    # e "She made you suffer, but you didn't try to refuse and fight back. Because deep down, your feelings for her were, and still are stronger than your anger."
    e "她让你吃了很多苦，但你没有拒绝过她，也没有反击过。因为在你心里，你对她的感情不管是过去还是现在都压过了你的愤怒。"

# game/script.rpy:1470
translate chinese emmapause_692c55ec:

    # e "So, I'm sure that you won't hurt her in any way. That's another reason."
    e "所以，我可以肯定你不会伤害她。这就是另一个原因。"

# game/script.rpy:1471
translate chinese emmapause_24b25b0f:

    # mc "*sighs*"
    mc "*叹气*"

# game/script.rpy:1472
translate chinese emmapause_8759c183:

    # mc "You told me that you're not going to order me around. But, isn't this like what you guys did to me back then?"
    mc "你刚刚说你不是来继续像以前一样使唤我的。但这跟你俩以前做的事有什么区别？"

# game/script.rpy:1473
translate chinese emmapause_19b61b16:

    # mc "Yeah, I admit it. It's not just that I liked her. I really loved her before. And I'm such an idiot for doing that!"
    mc "我可以承认。我以前喜欢她。那时候我真的很爱她。但那都是因为那时候我是个傻子！"

# game/script.rpy:1474
translate chinese emmapause_c6aea78c:

    # mc "However, I'm not that guy anymore, Emma. The me of the past is long gone, and that includes my feelings for Aine."
    mc "我现在已经变了，艾玛。过去的我早就不存在了，所以我对艾妮的感情也都消失了。"

# game/script.rpy:1475
translate chinese emmapause_d8813720:

    # mc "To be honest, I even swore to myself back then that I would get revenge on you guys. But I already moved on from that."
    mc "我实话告诉你吧，我之前甚至还发誓一定要报复你们。但我已经放下了。"

# game/script.rpy:1476
translate chinese emmapause_c79f3d2e:

    # mc "Heck, I didn't even want to see your faces here. I could've closed the door on you guys when you arrived earlier."
    mc "妈的，我甚至根本不想看见你们几个的脸。你们搬来的时候我就该把你们关在门外的。"

# game/script.rpy:1477
translate chinese emmapause_069d4d16:

    # mc "I know I should've done that because of what you guys did to me. But I'm not a douchebag who'd do that, and as I said, I already moved on from the past."
    mc "我知道就凭你们之前那样对我，我就该轰走你们。但我不是个能做出那种事情的人。而且我也说了，我已经放下过去了。"

# game/script.rpy:1478
translate chinese emmapause_7c93e053:

    # mc "But I can't just let you enter here and suddenly tell me that I need to marry the girl who bullied me back then, Emma!"
    mc "但我绝对不可能就这么答应跟以前霸凌我的女生结婚，艾玛！"

# game/script.rpy:1479
translate chinese emmapause_eeafb851:

    # mc "You're just thinking about your own benefit! But what about me? Did you even try to consider me in that plan of yours, huh?"
    mc "你只考虑了你自己！我呢？你在制定你的计划的时候有考虑过我怎么想吗，啊？"

# game/script.rpy:1480
translate chinese emmapause_0dd6c55c:

    # e "I..."
    e "我……"

# game/script.rpy:1481
translate chinese emmapause_f8a6b5e8:

    # mc "You didn't right? You just want what's best for Aine and that's it! Gwen lost her company, and you didn't even feel sorry for her at all?"
    mc "你没考虑过吧，对吧？你就只想着怎么才能让艾妮过上好日子！格温的公司都没了，你甚至都不伤心吗？"

# game/script.rpy:1482
translate chinese emmapause_1442eab1:

    # mc "Jesus, Emma! For a moment there, you showed me real emotion, but now, you're just back to that monotonous voice of yours!"
    mc "别扯淡了，艾玛！你刚刚还有那么一点点像有感情的正常人，现在你的声音又变得冷冰冰了！"

# game/script.rpy:1483
translate chinese emmapause_02676acf:

    # mc "You're really making me think that you're a robot or something, do you know that?"
    mc "我真觉得你就是个机器人，你知道吗？"

# game/script.rpy:1492
translate chinese emmapause_588f9608:

    # e "{i}N-no... you're wrong... I'm...{/i}"
    e "{i}不是的……不是那样的……我……{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:1493
translate chinese emmapause_24b25b0f_1:

    # mc "*sighs*"
    mc "*叹气*"

# game/script.rpy:1494
translate chinese emmapause_9d2cb525:

    # yt "What should I even do here?! I can't just agree to marry Aine just like that!"
    yt "我现在该怎么处理这情况？！我绝对不可能就这么答应跟艾妮结婚！"

# game/script.rpy:1495
translate chinese emmapause_1ce230fe:

    # yt "Well, I mean... Aine is really beautiful. And I totally wouldn't mind her becoming my wife. Ehe he heee~"
    yt "有一说一……艾妮确实非常漂亮。我完全不介意把她娶回家。哎嘿嘿嘿~"

# game/script.rpy:1496
translate chinese emmapause_d520d436:

    # yt "That is, if she hadn't done anything to me back then. I can't just marry the girl that made me suffer! That's just weird! What's more..."
    yt "当然了，那得是她以前没有那样欺负过我才行。我怎么可能跟让我吃尽苦头的那个女生结婚！太恶心了！而且……"

# game/script.rpy:1497
translate chinese emmapause_f151dcb0:

    # yt "Everything is just too sudden. And I bet she doesn't even know about Emma's plan at all..."
    yt "一切都太突然了。我甚至可以肯定艾妮根本对艾玛的计划一无所知……"

# game/script.rpy:1498
translate chinese emmapause_540f6071:

    # yt "There are still a lot of questions inside my head that I need to answer and discover about her."
    yt "关于艾妮，我还有无数的问题想要弄清楚。"

# game/script.rpy:1499
translate chinese emmapause_209653bb:

    # yt "It should be the other way around, but I need to know if she's really worthy of my handsome face..."
    yt "我得知道她能不能配得上我这张帅脸……"

# game/script.rpy:1500
translate chinese emmapause_a9985300:

    # yt "Wait, what am I saying?"
    yt "我操，我在想些什么？"

# game/script.rpy:1501
translate chinese emmapause_9d2648f5:

    # yt "Well... that's kind of true..."
    yt "不过……倒也不是没有道理……"

# game/script.rpy:1502
translate chinese emmapause_f3486065:

    # yt "All I have are looks and brains. I don't have the power to make things happen. Heck, I'm not even well known here in town."
    yt "我有的就只是外表跟头脑。我没能力去做任何大事。甚至连这条街上都没几个人认识我。"

# game/script.rpy:1503
translate chinese emmapause_1fdfa529:

    # yt "But still... I need to know my self-worth here."
    yt "但即便如此……我也需要知道我的价值在哪里。"

# game/script.rpy:1504
translate chinese emmapause_9fdd8781:

    # yt "I'm not going to just go along with this and let them do it, but I do need to let them redeem themselves to me."
    yt "我不会就这么同意她们的要求。我要反其道而行之，让她们向我证明，她们值得被我原谅。"

# game/script.rpy:1510
translate chinese emmapause_323bf1c7:

    # yt "!!!!"
    yt "！！！！"

# game/script.rpy:1511
translate chinese emmapause_1a8946cc:

    # yt "Holy shit!"
    yt "我操啊！"

# game/script.rpy:1512
translate chinese emmapause_ac153561:

    # yt "Why the hell did that pop inside my head all of a sudden?!"
    yt "我怎么突然会有这种想法？！"

# game/script.rpy:1513
translate chinese emmapause_9fee0834:

    # yt "Am I going crazy now?!"
    yt "我要发疯了吗？！"

# game/script.rpy:1514
translate chinese emmapause_2c0e825f:

    # yt "But..."
    yt "但是……"

# game/script.rpy:1515
translate chinese emmapause_d68ca11b:

    # yt "...that's right... everybody deserves a chance."
    yt "……说得也是……每个人都值得第二次机会。"

# game/script.rpy:1516
translate chinese emmapause_6481754f:

    # yt "Even the girl who bullied me in the past."
    yt "即使是以前欺负我的女生。"

# game/script.rpy:1517
translate chinese emmapause_413bc88c:

    # yt "Furthermore, about Aine's problem..."
    yt "而且，关于艾妮的问题……"

# game/script.rpy:1520
translate chinese emmapause_8f1a9d9d:

    # mc "You know that an Arranged Marriage won't happen unless both parties agree to it, right?"
    mc "你知道即使是包办婚姻也要两方都同意才可以吧？"

# game/script.rpy:1521
translate chinese emmapause_eba0422f:

    # mc "You're a private investigator, you should know that."
    mc "你是个私家侦探，应该很清楚。"

# game/script.rpy:1522
translate chinese emmapause_24d6b189:

    # e "I know that. But as I have told you, she doesn't have any control over her life decisions, Piggy."
    e "我知道。但我已经告诉过你了，艾妮对自己的人生完全没有决定权，猪头。"

# game/script.rpy:1523
translate chinese emmapause_fa1bf15e:

    # e "Her family will eventually force her to agree with it. No one could stop them doing so, not even the law. That's how powerful her family is."
    e "她家里人总会想办法强迫她同意的。谁也阻止不了他们，哪怕法律也不行。她的家族就是这么有权势。"

# game/script.rpy:1524
translate chinese emmapause_00172433:

    # mc "What a messed-up family she has! Then, how about you? You were appointed by her family right? Are you okay with betraying their trust?"
    mc "她家里都是些什么人啊！那你呢？你不是被她的家族派去服侍艾妮的吗？你就这么背叛她们对你的信任？"

# game/script.rpy:1525
translate chinese emmapause_906900bb:

    # e "I'm not betraying them. I'm just doing what they told me to do, and that's to serve and protect Aine."
    e "我没有背叛啊。他们让我服侍、保护艾妮，我只是在照做而已。"

# game/script.rpy:1526
translate chinese emmapause_00096e5a:

    # mc "Jeez... You're messed up too, you know that?"
    mc "天啊……你也多少有点问题了，你知道吗？"

# game/script.rpy:1527
translate chinese emmapause_ad6e165b_1:

    # e "......"
    e "…………"

# game/script.rpy:1528
translate chinese emmapause_e824402f:

    # mc "After thinking about it for a while and considering what you said about her family, getting us married will solve nothing."
    mc "根据你对她家庭情况的描述，结合我本人的看法，我的结论是即使我俩结婚也不会改变任何事情。"

# game/script.rpy:1529
translate chinese emmapause_b0bb7e5d:

    # mc "At the end of the day, even if we get married that doesn't free her from her family's control. It will take more than just that."
    mc "就算跟我结婚也没法让她逃离家里人的掌控。必须还要做更多才行。"

# game/script.rpy:1530
translate chinese emmapause_57890c46:

    # mc "I'm not saying that I agree to go along with this plan of yours. But I'm going to see how it goes from here."
    mc "我并不是同意你的计划的意思。但我会从现在开始看看我能做些什么。"

# game/script.rpy:1531
translate chinese emmapause_46684205:

    # mc "And I'm going to do it in my own way."
    mc "而且我要用自己的办法解决。"

# game/script.rpy:1532
translate chinese emmapause_b9ea8504:

    # mc "I may be soft hearted, and I did already move on from the past. Still, that doesn't deny the fact that you two gave me a hard time before. So I can't trust you just yet, Emma. I'm sorry."
    mc "我或许心肠很软，也确实把过去放下了。但是，你俩之前让我受苦的事实不会改变。所以我现在不能信任你，艾玛。对不起。"

# game/script.rpy:1533
translate chinese emmapause_aced0e58:

    # e "That's fine."
    e "没关系。"

# game/script.rpy:1534
translate chinese emmapause_f78ad360:

    # mc "Also, I have a few conditions."
    mc "而且，我还有几个条件。"

# game/script.rpy:1535
translate chinese emmapause_924d27d3:

    # e "What is it?"
    e "什么条件？"

# game/script.rpy:1536
translate chinese emmapause_57b07689:

    # mc "Stop spying on me. It makes me uncomfortable thinking that you might be just around a corner listening and watching what I do."
    mc "别再偷窥、跟踪我了。不管我在干什么，一想到可能你就在我身后实在是让我头皮发麻。"

# game/script.rpy:1537
translate chinese emmapause_9d2f2d12:

    # e "Alright."
    e "好吧。"

# game/script.rpy:1538
translate chinese emmapause_f3f56fd4:

    # mc "Promise me."
    mc "向我保证。"

# game/script.rpy:1539
translate chinese emmapause_df5268c0:

    # e "I promise."
    e "我保证。"

# game/script.rpy:1540
translate chinese emmapause_d2cd5b8c:

    # mc "Lastly, stop calling me 'Piggy' and call me by my name."
    mc "还有，不要再喊我猪头了，用我的名字称呼我。"

# game/script.rpy:1543
translate chinese emmapause_1a281840:

    # e "H-huh? B-but... I'm... already used to it."
    e "啊？可——可是……我已经……习惯那么喊你了。"

# game/script.rpy:1544
translate chinese emmapause_d5167816:

    # yt "Why is she acting like this all of a sudden?"
    yt "她怎么突然这个样子？"

# game/script.rpy:1545
translate chinese emmapause_12271f38:

    # mc "Then, you won't see me do anything for Aine."
    mc "那我什么也不会为艾妮做的。"

# game/script.rpy:1546
translate chinese emmapause_1622d0dc:

    # e "A-alright... I will... [mc!t]..."
    e "别！我答应你……[mc!t]……"

# game/script.rpy:1547
translate chinese emmapause_ad6e165b_2:

    # e "......"
    e "…………"

# game/script.rpy:1548
translate chinese emmapause_2b861e86:

    # e "{i}Saying his name once was okay, but twice is just... I-I can't let him see me like this!{/i}"
    e "{i}只说一次他的名字，我倒还能忍得住……但假如要说第二次，就……我——我不能让他看见我这样！{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:1549
translate chinese emmapause_4c94db02:

    # yt "Hmm?"
    yt "嗯？"

# game/script.rpy:1550
translate chinese emmapause_72d80974:

    # mc "Good! Then, we're done here. I'm going to bed now. I still have work tomorrow."
    mc "好！那我就没什么要说的了。我要去睡觉了。明天还要上班。"

# game/script.rpy:1551
translate chinese emmapause_577e4bd1:

    # e "Okay."
    e "好吧。"

# game/script.rpy:1560
translate chinese emmapause_ad38fb45:

    # "*thud*" with hpunch
    "*砰*" with hpunch

# game/script.rpy:1561
translate chinese emmapause_fd6c63e3:

    # e "{i}Ahhh-uuhh...{/i}"
    e "{i}唉……{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:1562
translate chinese emmapause_03c883d0:

    # e "{i}I knew this would happen...{/i}"
    e "{i}我就知道会这样……{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:1563
translate chinese emmapause_ad6e165b_3:

    # e "......"
    e "……"

# game/script.rpy:1564
translate chinese emmapause_b675bbcf:

    # e "{i}That was... the first time I ever talked to him without Aine beside me. That took all the courage and energy I have...{/i}"
    e "{i}这是……我第一次在艾妮不在身边的情况下跟他说话。花光了我所有的勇气和力气……{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:1565
translate chinese emmapause_8ff0ee2a:

    # e "{i}Thank god~ It's over... *sighs*{/i}"
    e "{i}谢天谢地~！还好我坚持下来了…… *叹气*{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:1566
translate chinese emmapause_e7d01867:

    # e "{i}But...{/i}"
    e "{i}但是……{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:1570
translate chinese emmapause_f3466473:

    # k "Emma! How are you doing, honey? I read the email you sent me!"
    k "艾玛！最近怎么样啊，亲爱的？我刚刚收到你给我发的邮件了！"

# game/script.rpy:1571
translate chinese emmapause_fc427ffe:

    # k "The last time we communicated was about a year ago!"
    k "我们上次说话都是一年前了！"

# game/script.rpy:1572
translate chinese emmapause_bf616950:

    # k "I'm still in shock over what I read, honey."
    k "亲爱的，你在邮件里说的事真的让我很震惊。"

# game/script.rpy:1573
translate chinese emmapause_fd5df8a2:

    # k "I didn't expect you to ask my permission for [mc!t] to marry your friend the moment we contacted each other again. *giggles*"
    k "我没想到分别一年之后，你回来的第一件事就是请我同意让[mc!t]跟你朋友结婚。 *笑*"

# game/script.rpy:1574
translate chinese emmapause_e773c4d7:

    # k "You're really a strange one, aren't you?"
    k "你可真奇怪。"

# game/script.rpy:1575
translate chinese emmapause_6c16b7cb:

    # k "Holding back your own feelings for the sake of your friend's well being."
    k "为了你朋友的幸福，压抑自己的感情。"

# game/script.rpy:1576
translate chinese emmapause_3ce45225:

    # e "Uhm... I don't understand what you're talking about, Miss Klara."
    e "嗯……我听不懂你在说什么，克拉拉太太。"

# game/script.rpy:1579
translate chinese emmapause_8d3c3ccd:

    # k "I'm a grown woman with a lot of experience, honey. Don't you think you were way too obvious when you contacted me to check on [mc!t] before?"
    k "我可是过来人了，亲爱的。你不觉得你之前联系我确认[mc!t]的情况的时候表现得太明显了吗？"

# game/script.rpy:1580
translate chinese emmapause_b7bb2454:

    # k "You may be a bright girl, but you're still too innocent about these kinds of things."
    k "或许你很聪明，但感情方面，你还是太纯真了。"

# game/script.rpy:1583
translate chinese emmapause_bf3d98d2:

    # e "What... are you..."
    e "您在……说什么呀……"

# game/script.rpy:1584
translate chinese emmapause_941e5f7e:

    # k "I wasn't able to personally confront you girls when you were bullying [mc!t] before, since I was always away due to the nature of my work. And that is something I deeply regret."
    k "你们以前霸凌[mc!t]的时候，我因为工作原因身处异国，不能亲自去保护他。这是我一辈子都会后悔的事。"

# game/script.rpy:1585
translate chinese emmapause_079958d6:

    # k "However, instead of me confronting you, to my surprise, you contacted me and kept apologizing all the time. Even when everything stopped after I escalated things to the school's deciplinary committee."
    k "不过，虽然我没法亲自去找你，你居然自己联系上了我，不断向我道歉。哪怕我向学校的纪律委员会举报，一切都已经停止以后，你还是一直这么做。"

# game/script.rpy:1586
translate chinese emmapause_31cd5824:

    # k "You were always concerned about him despite what you were doing to him."
    k "尽管你那么对他，但你一直都很关心他。"

# game/script.rpy:1587
translate chinese emmapause_c0d2d239:

    # k "So, I know that you like my [tenant!t], Emma. I know that you were just contacting me to check how he was doing."
    k "所以我知道你喜欢我的[tenant!t]，艾玛。我知道你是因为关心他才一直联系我，想知道他过得好不好的。"

# game/script.rpy:1590
translate chinese emmapause_ad6e165b_4:

    # e "......"
    e "…………"

# game/script.rpy:1591
translate chinese emmapause_bb5371d0:

    # k "See? You can't even deny it."
    k "看吧？你连反驳都没法反驳。"

# game/script.rpy:1592
translate chinese emmapause_8dfd344d:

    # k "At first I was extremely confused by you. You were giving my [tenant!t] a hard time, so why did you show concern for him."
    k "刚开始我真的搞不懂你在想什么。明明你一直在欺负我[tenant!t]，干嘛还要一直关心他？"

# game/script.rpy:1593
translate chinese emmapause_b1d2a78d:

    # k "However, I understood you as soon as I did some research and learned about you and your family's history."
    k "但是，在我知道你来自哪个家族之后，我立马就明白了。"

# game/script.rpy:1594
translate chinese emmapause_55050f3c:

    # k "I know that you are not allowed to do anything but serve and protect your friend. That's your duty, right?"
    k "我知道你除了服侍和保护你朋友之外，不被允许做其他任何事情。这是你的使命，对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:1595
translate chinese emmapause_5b0b01c1:

    # k "I'm not good with giving advice to people, but..."
    k "我不擅长给别人提建议，不过……"

# game/script.rpy:1596
translate chinese emmapause_1e7e38eb:

    # k "If ever [mc!t] and your friend get married, what about you? You can't just hide your feelings for my [tenant!t] forever, honey."
    k "假如你的朋友和[mc!t]真的结婚了，那你怎么办呢？你不可能一辈子都在我[tenant!t]面前隐藏你的感情的，亲爱的。"

# game/script.rpy:1597
translate chinese emmapause_d5777a21:

    # k "That will only make you suffer in the end."
    k "最后只会让你更加痛苦。"

# game/script.rpy:1600
translate chinese emmapause_41c4e93c:

    # e "I... I'm just a servant, Miss Klara. I don't have any control over myself. And..."
    e "我……我只是个仆人，克拉拉太太。我的命不是属于我自己的。而且……"

# game/script.rpy:1601
translate chinese emmapause_2ff5358c:

    # e "...I have no right to love anyone."
    e "……我没有资格去爱别人。"

# game/script.rpy:1602
translate chinese emmapause_c050fc50:

    # k "I disagree with you on that, honey. You were already in love with my [tenant!t]. You contacting me and checking on him is proof of you making a decision for yourself as well."
    k "你这话我可不爱听，宝贝。你已经爱上我[tenant!t]了。你之前不断联系我，关心他，也是你为你自己做决定的证明。"

# game/script.rpy:1603
translate chinese emmapause_ad6e165b_5:

    # e "......"
    e "…………"

# game/script.rpy:1604
translate chinese emmapause_b5592e9d:

    # k "You really don't talk much, do you?"
    k "你还是这么不爱说话，呵呵。"

# game/script.rpy:1605
translate chinese emmapause_52672b6f:

    # k "*sighs* Well then, about the marrying and stuff..."
    k "*叹气* 好吧，关于结婚的事……"

# game/script.rpy:1606
translate chinese emmapause_64624bf3:

    # k "I can't control [mc!t]'s decision about that, honey."
    k "我没法给[mc!t]做决定，亲爱的。"

# game/script.rpy:1607
translate chinese emmapause_15e23b47:

    # k "Even if I agree, it's still up to him if he wants it or not."
    k "即使我同意，最后也还是要问他的意见。"

# game/script.rpy:1608
translate chinese emmapause_ce3c9098:

    # k "What's more... they may be at the right age, but for me, they're still a bit too young to get married."
    k "而且……虽然他们都已经到年龄了，但我觉得他们还是太小了，不适合结婚。"

# game/script.rpy:1609
translate chinese emmapause_2bbdc422:

    # k "And how can they even get married if their relationship is in such a mess?"
    k "再说了，以他们现在的关系，怎么可能结婚呢？"

# game/script.rpy:1610
translate chinese emmapause_8f0ec64a:

    # e "I... don't know... I'll see what I can do about it, Miss Klara."
    e "我……也不知道……我之后会想办法的，克拉拉太太。"

# game/script.rpy:1611
translate chinese emmapause_57a5a1e9:

    # e "Maybe I could just tie them together with a rope until they forgive each other."
    e "实在不行我就用绳子把他们绑在一起，直到他们原谅彼此。"

# game/script.rpy:1612
translate chinese emmapause_940c9893:

    # k "*sighs* Look. I have an idea."
    k "*叹气* 这样吧，我有个办法。"

# game/script.rpy:1613
translate chinese emmapause_4765e1e8:

    # k "You guys are looking for a place to stay, right?"
    k "你们正在找新的住处，对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:1614
translate chinese emmapause_74db1a7f:

    # e "Yes..."
    e "是的……"

# game/script.rpy:1615
translate chinese emmapause_ab63f954:

    # k "I will put the other rooms in my house up for rent to you guys. But, don't tell [mc!t] that it was my idea, alright?"
    k "那我就把我家里的空房间租给你们。但是，不要告诉[mc!t]这是我的主意，知道了吗？"

# game/script.rpy:1616
translate chinese emmapause_4c81b67b:

    # k "It may be selfish of me to do this to him, but this is all for the better."
    k "我这样做是非常自私的，但也是为了他好。"

# game/script.rpy:1617
translate chinese emmapause_eb55f14e:

    # e "O-okay..."
    e "好-好吧……"

# game/script.rpy:1618
translate chinese emmapause_d641df8c:

    # k "You guys go and live there together with him."
    k "你们去跟他生活在一起。"

# game/script.rpy:1619
translate chinese emmapause_3b7c09b6:

    # k "This is a good chance. I think it's time for you guys to fix everything."
    k "这是个很好的机会。我想你们可以在此期间互相了解，修复关系。"

# game/script.rpy:1620
translate chinese emmapause_7e471890:

    # k "You are all grown up now — you're mature enough to know right from wrong."
    k "你们都长大了——可以自己分清对与错了。"

# game/script.rpy:1621
translate chinese emmapause_c1e34319:

    # k "And I just want to let you know that I'm not agreeing to your idea of marrying my [tenant!t] to your friend, honey. I still want what's best for my [tenant!t] as any [landlady!t] would."
    k "而且我要强调，我没有同意让你的朋友和我的[tenant!t]结婚，亲爱的。我是他[landlady!t]，我肯定想让我的[tenant!t]有最好的未来。"

# game/script.rpy:1622
translate chinese emmapause_01d736a2:

    # k "But, whatever happens from here on out will be up to you guys to decide. I won't interfere with your decisions."
    k "但从此以后，就交由你们来决定了。我不会干涉你们。"

# game/script.rpy:1623
translate chinese emmapause_a1f35a3f:

    # k "[mc!t] is mature enough to know what he wants and needs."
    k "[mc!t]已经长大了，知道他真正想要的是什么。"

# game/script.rpy:1624
translate chinese emmapause_8005d680:

    # k "And lastly, Emma?"
    k "还有一件事……"

# game/script.rpy:1625
translate chinese emmapause_f50fab36:

    # e "Yes, Miss Klara?"
    e "怎么了，克拉拉太太？"

# game/script.rpy:1626
translate chinese emmapause_55a89885:

    # k "Thank you for liking my [tenant!t] before despite his physical appearance. I know you didn't have any choice, so you must have endured a lot seeing him get hurt."
    k "谢谢你能喜欢我[tenant!t]，尽管以前他的外貌并不出众。我知道你什么也做不了，所以看到他吃苦，你肯定也不好受。"

# game/script.rpy:1627
translate chinese emmapause_9b53f710:

    # k "If it was up to me... It would be you that I want my [tenant!t] to marry. Despite everything, I know that you're a good soul."
    k "要是问我的话……我想让我[tenant!t]跟你结婚。尽管发生了这么多，我知道你依然是个好女孩。"

# game/script.rpy:1630
translate chinese emmapause_ad6e165b_6:

    # e "......"
    e "…………"

# game/script.rpy:1631
translate chinese emmapause_27b09d7e:

    # e "......*sobs*"
    e "………… *抽泣*"

# game/script.rpy:1632
translate chinese emmapause_12f1adb1:

    # k "I'm sorry, honey... I trust you on this. I'll leave everything to you for now. Don't let me down."
    k "对不起，亲爱的……在这件事上，我很信任你。我就把一切都交给你了。不要让我失望。"

# game/script.rpy:1635
translate chinese emmapause_77d7ffc7:

    # e "{i}Miss Klara... What do I do now?{/i}"
    e "{i}克拉拉太太……我该怎么办？{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:1648
translate chinese emmapause_323bf1c7_1:

    # yt "!!!!"
    yt "！！！！"

# game/script.rpy:1649
translate chinese emmapause_480bf0f5:

    # yt "AAAHHHH~!!!"
    yt "啊啊啊啊啊啊~！！！"

# game/script.rpy:1652
translate chinese emmapause_25a484e3:

    # yt "I can't sleep at all~! I still have work tomorrow for Christ's sake!"
    yt "我根本睡不着~！天啊，我明天明明还得上班！"

# game/script.rpy:1653
translate chinese emmapause_343cf69c:

    # yt "I can't help but think about what Emma and I discussed down stairs!"
    yt "我脑子里全是我和艾玛在楼下说的那些事！"

# game/script.rpy:1654
translate chinese emmapause_9ed22942:

    # yt "'I'm gOiNg tO sEe hOw iT gOeS fRoM hErE.'"
    yt "“但我会从现在开始看看我能做些什么。”"

# game/script.rpy:1655
translate chinese emmapause_24d89f3c:

    # yt "You don't even know what to do, you idiot!"
    yt "我话是这么说，但根本不知道该干什么，我真是个傻子！"

# game/script.rpy:1656
translate chinese emmapause_2e620b52:

    # yt "If I ever do make a move with Aine. I will come up against her family for sure!"
    yt "要是我真的去帮艾妮，我肯定就成了她的家族的敌人！"

# game/script.rpy:1657
translate chinese emmapause_78096e63:

    # yt "And... what's with Emma's reaction earlier? She's really confusing the hell out of me!"
    yt "还有……为什么艾玛之前会有那种反应？我真的搞不懂她！"

# game/script.rpy:1658
translate chinese emmapause_74f80118:

    # yt "For a moment she shows a bit of her emotion, and then she goes back to being a robot all of a sudden. What's wrong with her?!"
    yt "有那么一小会她好像有了感情，然后立马就又变回机器人了。她到底有什么毛病？！"

# game/script.rpy:1661
translate chinese emmapause_197d4876:

    # yt "Urrgghh! Stop thinking about it already!"
    yt "烦死了！不能再继续想了！"

# game/script.rpy:1664
translate chinese emmapause_2a0ad364:

    # yt "*sighs*"
    yt "*叹气*"

# game/script.rpy:1665
translate chinese emmapause_cbd7e559:

    # yt "What should I do now? I can't really sleep."
    yt "我现在要干嘛？我真的睡不着。"

# game/script.rpy:1666
translate chinese emmapause_b2ff5153:

    # yt "Should I play some computer games?"
    yt "要去玩游戏吗？"

# game/script.rpy:1667
translate chinese emmapause_bbcff8ac:

    # yt "Nah... That will just make things worse."
    yt "不行……只会让事情更糟。"

# game/script.rpy:1668
translate chinese emmapause_c534d4d9:

    # yt "I remember playing that famous game called Genshin Impact once, and before I even realized it, it was already 5 in the morning!"
    yt "我上次玩那个叫原神的游戏，一不小心就玩到了凌晨五点！"

# game/script.rpy:1669
translate chinese emmapause_d275a3ee:

    # yt "Good thing it was my day off!"
    yt "还好那天我休息！"

# game/script.rpy:1670
translate chinese emmapause_f13446ab:

    # yt "So, not a good idea!"
    yt "所以肯定不能玩游戏！"

# game/script.rpy:1671
translate chinese emmapause_e55b9a70:

    # yt "......"
    yt "…………"

# game/script.rpy:1672
translate chinese emmapause_9b621704:

    # yt "Well then, I guess I'll just head downstairs and see if there's something I can eat. Maybe a full stomach will help me sleep later."
    yt "好吧，那我就下楼看看有没有什么能吃的吧。吃饱了说不定更容易睡着。"

# game/script.rpy:1683
translate chinese emmapause_dee6a216:

    # yt "Gwen?"
    yt "格温？"

# game/script.rpy:1684
translate chinese emmapause_b437a1f1:

    # yt "Drinking wine in the middle of the night, huh?"
    yt "半夜起来喝酒？"

# game/script.rpy:1685
translate chinese emmapause_f2576022:

    # yt "Well, what do I even expect from her? She was a drunkard back in highschool. Only difference now is that she can do it in style. *chuckles*"
    yt "倒也正常，她不就是这种人吗？高中的时候就是个酒鬼。唯一的区别是现在喝得更优雅了。 *笑*"

# game/script.rpy:1688
translate chinese emmapause_a2a3593e:

    # g "Hey... Can't sleep?"
    g "嘿……睡不着吗？"

# game/script.rpy:1689
translate chinese emmapause_5df4435f:

    # mc "Yeah, how did you know?"
    mc "对啊，你怎么知道？"

# game/script.rpy:1690
translate chinese emmapause_a36c51cd:

    # g "Just a guess, since I couldn't sleep either."
    g "乱猜的，因为我也睡不着。"

# game/script.rpy:1691
translate chinese emmapause_dbcf54fa:

    # mc "Is that why you're drinking?"
    mc "所以起来喝酒？"

# game/script.rpy:1692
translate chinese emmapause_061e4455:

    # g "Yeah... I can't sleep thinking about what happened to my company."
    g "对啊……一想到公司的事就怎么也睡不着。"

# game/script.rpy:1693
translate chinese emmapause_e9fc61a4:

    # yt "She must be really devastated from losing her company. Well, of course she would be. It's a company we're talking about here."
    yt "丢掉公司肯定是让她很不好受。这倒是非常正常。毕竟是自己的公司。"

# game/script.rpy:1694
translate chinese emmapause_b6b22bf2:

    # g "By the way, do you want some?"
    g "对了，你要喝吗？"

# game/script.rpy:1699
translate chinese emmapause_f43d95c3:

    # mc "Hm... Sure, just a little bit."
    mc "嗯……好啊，我只喝一点就行了。"

# game/script.rpy:1701
translate chinese emmapause_1c5512b4:

    # mc "Uh... No, thanks. I'm good. I just came here to eat."
    mc "呃……不用了，谢谢。我只是来吃东西的。"

# game/script.rpy:1702
translate chinese emmapause_f57042cd:

    # g "No worries."
    g "没事。"

# game/script.rpy:1710
translate chinese emmapause_af47b530:

    # mc "Ahh... That was good!"
    mc "啊……真好吃！"

# game/script.rpy:1711
translate chinese emmapause_07baa9e0:

    # g "Hmm... noodles, huh? They're not good for you, you know?"
    g "嗯……吃泡面吗？可不太健康啊？"

# game/script.rpy:1712
translate chinese emmapause_fba4a5c9:

    # yt "Are you my [landlady!t] or something?"
    yt "你是我[landlady!t]吗？"

# game/script.rpy:1715
translate chinese emmapause_b0d2495a:

    # mc "Well, this is the quickest food I can fix. I need to go back to bed soon as I have to work tomorrow."
    mc "呃，这是我能最快吃到的东西了。我明天还要上班，得尽快回去睡觉才行。"

# game/script.rpy:1716
translate chinese emmapause_7d20b2e4:

    # g "Oh, that's right. You work in a burger shack in midtown."
    g "哦，对了。你在城里的汉堡店上班。"

# game/script.rpy:1717
translate chinese emmapause_cf1adef2:

    # mc "Yeah."
    mc "是的。"

# game/script.rpy:1718
translate chinese emmapause_d78fe070:

    # g "Before you head back to your room, can I ask you something?"
    g "你回房间之前我能问你点事情吗？"

# game/script.rpy:1719
translate chinese emmapause_f2c7f1da:

    # mc "Sure, what is it?"
    mc "当然可以，怎么了？"

# game/script.rpy:1720
translate chinese emmapause_1fd6400a:

    # g "Do you..."
    g "你还……"

# game/script.rpy:1721
translate chinese emmapause_7805002e:

    # g "...remember me, [mc!t]?"
    g "……记得我吗，[mc!t]？"

# game/script.rpy:1722
translate chinese emmapause_70c39315:

    # yt "Uh-oh..."
    yt "不妙……"

# game/script.rpy:1723
translate chinese emmapause_1fa96034:

    # mc "W-what do you mean?"
    mc "你-你什么意思？"

# game/script.rpy:1726
translate chinese emmapause_57cb816b:

    # g "Ohh... No need to pretend anymore, [mc!t]. We're alone here. I know that it's you! *giggles*"
    g "哎呀……没必要再装了，[mc!t]。这里就我们两个人。我知道是你！ *笑*"

# game/script.rpy:1727
translate chinese emmapause_44611f5c:

    # g "I didn't remember you until we met earlier, though..."
    g "不过我直到再见到你，才想起你这个人……"

# game/script.rpy:1728
translate chinese emmapause_74699324:

    # g "Things were so busy during and after college that I didn't have any time to even think about the past."
    g "自从上了大学，我整个人都忙得不行，连回忆过去的时间都没有了，毕业后也是如此。"

# game/script.rpy:1729
translate chinese emmapause_baca10f9:

    # g "You've really changed so much! But, I can still feel some of the old you!"
    g "你可真是变了不少！但我还是能感觉得到以前的你。"

# game/script.rpy:1730
translate chinese emmapause_94cb81ee:

    # g "You remember me, right? right?? Hehehe~"
    g "你还记得我，对吧？对吧？？嘿嘿嘿~"

# game/script.rpy:1733
translate chinese emmapause_3a2c2c2b:

    # yt "She's gone from serious to playful. I guess she's still the Gwen that I knew back then."
    yt "她的语气从严肃变得轻松了。我想她依然还是那个我认识的格温。"

# game/script.rpy:1736
translate chinese emmapause_0459b405:

    # mc "*sighs* Alright! Yes, I remember you. Not just you, I remember Aine and Emma too!"
    mc "*叹气* 好吧！我承认，我还记得你。不只是你，我也记得艾妮和艾玛！"

# game/script.rpy:1738
translate chinese emmapause_da11b229:

    # mc "No, I... don't."
    mc "不，我……我不记得了。"

# game/script.rpy:1739
translate chinese emmapause_c751d8ea:

    # g "Oh, come on... I know that you remember me! Stop pretending already!"
    g "你呀，少来这套了！我知道你记得了！别装了！"

# game/script.rpy:1740
translate chinese emmapause_bd0810b3:

    # mc "*sighs* Alright, I remember you. Not just you, I remember Aine and Emma too!"
    mc "*叹气* 好吧！我承认，我还记得你。不只是你，我也记得艾妮和艾玛！"

# game/script.rpy:1741
translate chinese emmapause_309ea1f0:

    # g "See?"
    g "我就说吧？"

# game/script.rpy:1744
translate chinese emmapause_6df9caff:

    # g "Who knew that this is how we would meet again? Hehehe~"
    g "谁能想到我们会这样重逢？哈哈哈~"

# game/script.rpy:1745
translate chinese emmapause_d23b8bdc:

    # yt "Only Emma. *chuckles*"
    yt "艾玛能想到。 *笑*"

# game/script.rpy:1746
translate chinese emmapause_41ae8235:

    # g "Hehe~ So you do still remember me, huh? Well I know you would..."
    g "嘿嘿~所以你还记得我是吧？我就知道你忘不掉……"

# game/script.rpy:1747
translate chinese emmapause_7f6f907b:

    # mc "Of course. How could I forget about you after what happened in the past?"
    mc "那是当然。过去发生过那种事，我怎么可能忘记你？"

# game/script.rpy:1750
translate chinese emmapause_6a61caa4:

    # g "Hey~! I didn't do anything to you before!"
    g "喂~！我之前可没欺负过你啊！"

# game/script.rpy:1751
translate chinese emmapause_7d98e7ff:

    # mc "Ehh... no I didn't mean that."
    mc "呃……我不是那个意思。"

# game/script.rpy:1752
translate chinese emmapause_88d75efc:

    # mc "Did you already forget about what happened to us that one time?"
    mc "你忘了那次我们俩的事了吗？"

# game/script.rpy:1755
translate chinese emmapause_2a08bf92:

    # g "Oh..."
    g "呃……"

# game/script.rpy:1756
translate chinese emmapause_b0f307d5:

    # g "...that... I didn't! But still, it was both our first time... So I think it's only fair!"
    g "……那次……我没忘！不过，反正咱们两个都是第一次……所以我觉得咱俩也算扯平了！"

# game/script.rpy:1757
translate chinese emmapause_0542fc42:

    # g "Yeah, I was drunk, but I already apologized for giving you that... that... big..."
    g "对，那天我喝醉了，但我已经道歉了。我不该给你带来如此……大的……"

# game/script.rpy:1758
translate chinese emmapause_c3184490:

    # g "Ahh! Nevermind! I just took responsibility! You also agreed to do it with me anyway!"
    g "啊啊啊！不管了！我来负责就是了！而且反正那天你也同意了！"

# game/script.rpy:1761
translate chinese emmapause_08054f46:

    # yt "Well, that's true. I agreed to it out of curiosity and lust..."
    yt "好吧，这倒没错。我那时候因为好奇和色心同意了……"

# game/script.rpy:1762
translate chinese emmapause_e9263515:

    # yt "Gwen was my soft spot since she didn't really do anything to me. In fact, she even tried to defend me one time."
    yt "格温算是我的软肋，因为她什么也没对我做过。有一次她还试着保护我。"

# game/script.rpy:1763
translate chinese emmapause_714d4bc5:

    # yt "Although I was not very willing, I still found myself helping her every time she needed it."
    yt "尽管我自己不怎么愿意，但我总是会在她需要的时候去帮她。"

# game/script.rpy:1764
translate chinese emmapause_3c700dc3:

    # yt "To be honest, I was also following Emma and Aine's orders, but it was different with Gwen since she didn't force me to do anything for her."
    yt "说实话，我也一直给艾玛和艾妮做事，但格温不一样，因为她没强迫我给她做过任何事。"

# game/script.rpy:1768
translate chinese emmapause_ef11e3ba:

    # yt "It was during the afternoon class..."
    yt "那是一天下午……"

# game/script.rpy:1769
translate chinese emmapause_d458eedc:

    # yt "I was on my way back from the restroom to our classroom when I found her in the corridor drunk."
    yt "我从厕所出来准备回教室，发现她醉倒在走廊上。"

# game/script.rpy:1773
translate chinese emmapause_dc6cd4bb:

    # mc "Gwen?"
    mc "格温？"

# game/script.rpy:1776
translate chinese emmapause_d686e0c7:

    # mc "H-hey, Gwen. Why are you-"
    mc "你-你好，格温。你怎么……"

# game/script.rpy:1779
translate chinese emmapause_37ec36ae:

    # mc "Eek! You reek of alcohol!"
    mc "呕！你身上酒气也太重了！"

