translate chinese ep1_8430ef8c:

    # un "Time is a trivial thing. I shall hark e'en if it takes years~"
    un "所谓时间，不过小事耳。纵使要花上千年，我亦会伴君左右，侧耳倾听。"

# game/script.rpy:21
translate chinese ep1_54f2fcc0:

    # mc "Jesus, what's with the way you talk?"
    mc "天啊，怎么会有人这么说话啊？"

# game/script.rpy:22
translate chinese ep1_d881c3d2:

    # mc "Well, alright. Let's start with how I met them."
    mc "算了，好吧。就从我怎么遇见她们的开始说起。"

# game/script.rpy:23
translate chinese ep1_0fab8a36:

    # mc "But, let me tell you about myself and this photo first."
    mc "但首先，我还是先跟你讲讲我自己和这张照片吧。"

# game/script.rpy:35
translate chinese ep1_59c26355:

    # mc "My name is [mc!t], 23 years old."
    mc "我叫[mc!t]，23岁。"

# game/script.rpy:43
translate chinese ep1_4397b420:

    # mc "However, it was not that easy with the state of society back then."
    mc "但是，考虑到那个时候的社会状况，工作赚钱也并不容易。"

# game/script.rpy:46
translate chinese ep1_4cd8260a:

    # mc "So... I decided to temporarily find something I could do to get by, until I could find a job within my field of study."
    mc "所以……我决定先暂时找一个能糊口的工作，再慢慢去找我的专业领域的工作。"

# game/script.rpy:47
translate chinese ep1_8368c059:

    # mc "I mean... what else could I have done? At least the pay covered my daily expenses and needs."
    mc "我说……我也没什么别的选择了吧？至少那里的薪水足够我的日常花销了。"

# game/script.rpy:69
translate chinese ep1_242bf781:

    # mc "She's a very lovely girl who always took care of me and the entire house."
    mc "她非常可爱，还一直照顾我，打理整个房子。"

# game/script.rpy:70
translate chinese ep1_578c79de:

    # mc "She is working as an online English tutor for foreign kids."
    mc "她的工作是在网上给外国的小孩子上英语课。"

# game/script.rpy:71
translate chinese ep1_9140962f:

    # mc "But despite it being stressful, I could still see that she loves her job."
    mc "尽管压力不小，但我能看得出来她十分热爱这份工作。"

# game/script.rpy:72
translate chinese ep1_ba8a6df9:

